INFO 03-13 07:53:43 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-8ceb04ec404945b28ac2cec71d1456df-0: prompt: 'Macaque pulled MK into a tight embrace as they landed on a nearby rooftop. MK was shaking and crying, his face buried in Macaque\'s fur.\n\n"It\'s okay, MK. You\'re safe now," Macaque whispered as he gently stroked MK\'s back.\n\n"I...I thought he was going to kill me," MK choked out between sobs.\n\n"I know, I know," Macaque said soothingly. "But he\'s gone now. You\'re okay."\n\nMK took a few deep breaths, trying to calm himself down. After a moment, he pulled away from Macaque and wiped his eyes. "Thank you," he said quietly.\n\nMacaque gave him a small smile. "Anytime, kid. That\'s what I\'m here for."\n\nMK looked down at his hands, still shaking. "I...I don\'t know what to do now," he admitted.\n\n"We\'ll figure it out," Macaque said reassuringly. "Right now, let\'s just rest for a bit."\n\nMK nodded, and the two of them sat in silence for a few minutes, catching their breath. Macaque kept a watchful eye on the sky, just in case Wukong came back, while MK tried to calm himself down.\n\nAfter a while, MK looked up at Macaque. "I\'m sorry," he said. "I\'m sorry for not listening to you, for being reckless."\n\nMacaque shook his head. "It\'s not your fault, MK. You\'re just a kid. You\'re not used to dealing with all this...craziness. But you\'re learning, and you\'re getting stronger. And I\'ll always be here to protect you."\n\nMK smiled weakly. "Thanks, Macaque. You\'re the best."\n\nMacaque grinned. "Yeah, I know." He tousled MK\'s hair affectionately. "Now come on, let\'s get some sleep. We\'ve got a big day tomorrow."\n\nMK nodded and followed Macaque back inside, feeling grateful for the monkey\'s presence and protection.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, igno