INFO 03-13 07:53:43 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-30cc169af3c4402c92551ca709176609-0: prompt: '[Visual] Cut to a shot of a person opening the fridge and looking inside.\n\n[Script] "When it comes to weight loss, calories are king."\n\n[Visual] Show a person cutting vegetables on a cutting board.\n\n[Script] "You need to burn more calories than you consume in order to lose weight."\n\n[Visual] Cut to a person eating a salad with grilled chicken.\n\n[Script] "That\'s where the concept of calorie deficit comes in. In other words, you need to eat fewer calories than you burn in order to lose weight."\n\n[Visual] Show a person feeling hungry while holding an empty plate.\n\n[Script] "However, there\'s a common misconception that you need to eat as little as possible in order to create a calorie deficit."\n\n[Visual] Cut to a person eating a small, unsatisfying meal.\n\n[Script] "The truth is, if you restrict your calories too much, your body will go into starvation mode and slow down your metabolism to conserve energy, making it harder to lose weight."\n\n[Visual] Show a person eating a healthy, satisfying meal.\n\n[Script] "So how can you create a calorie deficit without starving yourself?"\n\n[Visual] Show a person cooking healthy meals in their kitchen.\n\n[Script] "The answer is to eat more of the right foods, specifically foods that are high in protein, fiber, and water content can help boost your metabolism and help you burn more calories."\n\n[Visual] Show a person eating a piece of salmon.\n\n[Script] "Some examples of these foods include lean proteins like chicken and fish that are high in omega-3 fatty acids, like salmon, tuna, and trout, which can support brain function and are linked to reduced risk of heart disease, stroke, and certain types of cancer."\n\n[Visual] Show a person eating a bowl of lentil soup.\n\n[Script] "And finally, legumes like beans, lentils, peas, and chickpeas, along with whole grains like brown rice and quinoa, are nutrient-rich foods that offer high protein and fiber."\n\n[Visual] Show a person eating a salad with lots of vegetables.\n\n[Script] "Also, make sure to include plenty of fruits and vegetables in your diet as these are high in fiber and other important nutrients."\n\n[Visual] Show a person using measuring cups to control their portion sizes.\n\n[Script] "By eating more of the right foods, you can actually boost your metabolism and lose weight more effectively. And the best part, you\'ll feel fuller and more satisfied throughout the day."\n\n[Visual] Show a person drinking a glass of water.\n\n[Script] "In addition to eating the right foods, portion control is key. Eating too much of even the healthiest foods can still lead to weight gain."\n\n[Visual] Show a person filling up a reusable water bottle.\n\n[Script] "So make sure to keep an eye on your portion sizes and aim for balanced meals that include protein, complex carbs, healthy fats, and lots of veggies."\n\n[Visual] Show a person preparing meals for the week and placing them in containers.\n\n[Script] "Planning ahead and prepping meals is also a great way to stay on track and make sure you have healthy nutrient-dense foods on hand when hunger strikes."\n\n[Visual] Show a person reaching for a piece of fruit as a healthy snack.\n\n[Script] "When you\'re in a rush or on the go, it\'s easy to reach for unhealthy snacks like chips or candy. Instead, keep healthy snacks like fruit, nuts, or veggie sticks on hand for a quick, easy, and nutritious snack."\n\n[Visual] Show a person using herbs and spices to add flavor to their cooking.\n\n[Script] "Eating healthy doesn\'t have to be boring. Experiment with different herbs', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=N