INFO 03-13 07:53:45 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-2192386e729f46a185b8dc16ceb3f225-0: prompt: "Natalia, Ashley, Jack, Michael, Cindy, and Steve had been planning their camping trip for months. They arrived at the campsite in high spirits, eager to spend a weekend in the great outdoors. The campsite was situated in a dense forest, with tall trees looming overhead and a babbling stream running nearby.\n\nOn the first night of their trip, they sat around a roaring campfire, swapping stories and enjoying each other's company. But as the night wore on, they began to feel a strange, unsettling presence around them.\n\nAt first, they dismissed it as the wind rustling through the trees, but soon they realized that something was amiss. They heard footsteps crunching through the underbrush, and saw shadowy figures darting around the edge of the clearing.\n\nIt was then that they caught a glimpse of the ghostly figure in the woods. Its eyes glowed with a malevolent light, and it seemed to be watching them with a sinister intent.\n\nThe campers were terrified, but they didn't want to give in to their fear. They tried to continue with their camping activities, but the ghostly presence only grew stronger. They could hear eerie whispers echoing through the trees, and the wind began to howl with an otherworldly force.\n\nOne night, as they were walking through the woods, they came across a rickety rope bridge suspended high above a ravine. The bridge creaked and swayed precariously in the wind, and the campers hesitated.\n\nBut the ghost was closing in fast, and they had no choice but to cross the bridge. They started to make their way across, one by one, gripping the ropes tightly and trying not to look down.\n\nAs they were nearing the end of the bridge, the last camper suddenly heard a loud snap. The rope bridge gave way beneath her feet, and she found herself plummeting towards the water below.\n\nBut in a split second, she managed to grab hold of the ropes and pull herself back up. She was left dangling in mid-air, her legs kicking wildly as she struggled to find her footing.\n\nThe other campers rushed to her aid, reaching out to grab her hands and pull her to safety. It was a tense and nerve-wracking moment, but they managed to hold on and pull her back to solid ground.\n\nAs they caught their breath and looked back at the bridge, they saw that it had been completely destroyed. They knew that if they had hesitated for even a moment longer, they would have all fallen to their deaths.\n\nDespite their near-death experience, the campers refused to give up. They knew that they had to find a way to escape the ghostly presence and make it back to civilization.\n\nThey continued on their way, trying to stay together and stay alert for any sign of danger. As they walked, they could feel the ghostly presence closing in around them, but they refused to give up.\n\nFinally, after what seemed like hours of walking, they saw a glimmer of light in the distance. They quickened their pace, their hearts pounding with excitement and fear.\n\nAs they emerged from the forest, they saw the lights of a nearby town shining in the distance. They had made it out alive, and they knew that they would never forget the terror they had faced in those haunted woods.\n\nBut they also knew that they had proven their strength and bravery in the face of the unknown, and that they would always be able to face any challenge that came their way.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [45, 4212, 685, 11, 37118, 11, 7607, 11, 7937, 11, 69331, 11, 323, 13809, 1030, 