INFO 03-13 07:53:47 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-de870cbe3dd34853a7653c46f9f38018-0: prompt: 'Certainly, let\'s give it a try:\n\nTommy slumps down in his chair, arms folded, as his dad enters the room. "Hey, sport, how was your day?"\n\nTommy looks up briefly, then back down. "It was fine," he says.\n\nDavid nods, then takes a seat across from Tommy. "Anything interesting happen at school today?"\n\nTommy\'s face contorts slightly, as if he\'s thinking about how to respond. "Not really," he says. "Just the usual stuff."\n\nDavid leans forward slightly. "What kind of usual stuff?"\n\nTommy hesitates for a moment, then begins. "You know, just the stuff that always happens. Kids being mean to each other, stuff like that."\n\nDavid\'s face tightens. "Kids being mean to each other? What do you mean?"\n\nTommy shrugs. "Just stuff. Like, they make fun of me for not having the latest phone or whatever."\n\nDavid nods slowly. "I know how that is. When I was your age, I didn\'t fit in either. But you know what? You just have to be yourself, and eventually people will come around."\n\nTommy rolls his eyes. "It\'s not that easy, Dad. You don\'t understand what it\'s like these days. It\'s all about social media and followers and likes and stuff. I just don\'t fit in."\n\nDavid leans back in his chair, crossing his arms. "I understand that it\'s hard, Tommy. But you can\'t let those things define you. You have to find the things that make you unique and embrace them."\n\nTommy\'s tone is increasingly exasperated. "It\'s not that simple, Dad. You don\'t get it. Nobody gets it."\n\nAs the tension in the room starts to build, Tommy\'s mom enters, holding a plate of cookies. "Hey, boys, what\'s going on in here?"\n\nDavid\'s face softens slightly. "Just trying to have a heart-to-heart with my son."\n\nTommy\'s mom sets the cookies down on the table. "Well, how about we take a break from all this serious talk and have a treat? It\'s a beautiful day outside, maybe we could take a walk later?"\n\nTommy and David exchange a quick glance before Tommy stands up. "I have some homework to do," he mumbles, before heading up to his room.\n\nDavid watches him go, then turns to his wife with a heavy sigh. "I just don\'t know what to do," he says. "He\'s so different from how I was at that age."\n\nHis wife puts a hand on his shoulder. "I know, dear. But we\'ll figure it out. We\'ll just have to keep trying."', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [95456, 11, 1077, 594, 2968, 432, 264, 1430, 1447, 24732, 2408, 1739, 11793, 1495, 304, 806, 10496, 11, 11715, 47035, 11, 438, 806, 17760, 28833, 279, 3054, 13, 330, 18665, 11, 10552, 11, 1246, 572, 697, 1899, 11974, 24732, 2408, 5868, 705, 26753, 11, 1221, 1182, 1495, 13, 330, 2132, 572, 6915, 1335, 566, 2727, 382, 22286, 82659, 11, 1221, 4990, 264, 10723, 3941, 504, 39039, 13, 330, 77303, 7040, 3537, 518, 2906, 3351, 11974, 24732, 2408, 594, 3579, 683, 18955, 10078, 11, 438, 421, 566, 594, 7274, 911, 1246, 311, 5889, 13, 330, 2623, 2167, 1335, 566, 2727, 13, 330, 9952, 279, 13475, 6259, 2217, 22286, 92836, 4637, 10078, 13, 330, 3838, 3093, 315, 13475, 6259, 11974, 24732, 2408, 19779, 81729, 369, 264, 4445, 11, 1221, 12033, 13, 330, 2610, 1414, 11, 1101, 279, 6259, 429, 2677, 8573, 13, 22522, 1660, 3076, 311, 1817, 1008, 11, 6259, 1075, 429, 2217, 22286, 594, 3579, 10296, 724, 13, 330, 69433, 1660, 3076, 311, 1817, 1008, 30, 3555, 653, 498, 3076, 11974, 24732, 2408, 14035, 13299, 13, 330, 9952, 6259, 13, 8909, 11, 807, 1281, 2464, 315, 752, 369, 537, 3432, 279, 5535, 4540, 476, 8820, 2217, 22286, 826