INFO 03-13 07:53:48 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-7d69642e031e4e8198ea0ac864397de5-0: prompt: "Creating a rotating list of clothes in your capsule wardrobe that all color match together can help to simplify your morning routine and ensure that you always have a variety of coordinated outfits to choose from. Here are a few steps to help you create a rotating list of clothes that all color match together:\n\n1. Choose a color palette: Identify the colors that complement your skin undertone and that flatter your body type. Stick to a neutral color palette, with one or two accent colors. This will help you to build a cohesive wardrobe that is easy to mix and match.\n2. Plan your outfits: Plan your outfits in advance by mixing and matching different pieces in your wardrobe. This will help you to see how the different pieces work together and ensure that you have a variety of different looks to choose from.\n3. Invest in quality basics: Invest in quality basics such as well-fitting dress pants, dress shirts, blazers, and nice shoes. These are the foundation of your wardrobe and can be dressed up or down depending on the occasion.\n4. Add in statement pieces: Add in statement pieces such as a bold blazer, patterned shirt, or colorful scarf to add some visual interest to your wardrobe.\n5. Keep it organized: Keep your wardrobe organized by storing your clothes in an orderly fashion. This will make it easier to see everything you have and plan your outfits.\n6. Rotate your clothes: Create a rotation system for your clothes, by using some clothes for a week, then put them away and use others for the next week, this will ensure that you are not wearing the same clothes over and over again.\n7. Accessorize: Use accessories such as belts, ties, and jewelry to add visual interest to your outfits and tie everything together.\n8. Be mindful of the fabrics: Be mindful of the fabrics you choose, natural fabrics like cotton, linen, wool are breathable, comfortable, and durable.\n\nBy following these steps, you'll be able to create a rotating list of clothes that all color match together, giving you variety yet simplicity of choice in the morning. Remember to be mindful of your proportions and choose clothes that fit you well and make you feel confident.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [24973, 264, 41396, 1140, 315, 15097, 304, 697, 47639, 45746, 429, 678, 1894, 2432, 3786, 646, 1492, 311, 39721, 697, 6556, 14021, 323, 5978, 429, 498, 2677, 614, 264, 8045, 315, 46572, 47274, 311, 5157, 504, 13, 5692, 525, 264, 2421, 7354, 311, 1492, 498, 1855, 264, 41396, 1140, 315, 15097, 429, 678, 1894, 2432, 3786, 1447, 16, 13, 22201, 264, 1894, 26308, 25, 64547, 279, 7987, 429, 22766, 697, 6787, 18649, 603, 323, 429, 1320, 1650, 697, 2487, 943, 13, 46461, 311, 264, 20628, 1894, 26308, 11, 448, 825, 476, 1378, 29100, 7987, 13, 1096, 686, 1492, 498, 311, 1936, 264, 86416, 45746, 429, 374, 4135, 311, 6514, 323, 2432, 624, 17, 13, 9680, 697, 47274, 25, 9680, 697, 47274, 304, 11912, 553, 26792, 323, 12579, 2155, 9666, 304, 697, 45746, 13, 1096, 686, 1492, 498, 311, 1490, 1246, 279, 2155, 9666, 975, 3786, 323, 5978, 429, 498, 614, 264, 8045, 315, 2155, 5868, 311, 5157, 504, 624, 18, 13, 12748, 304, 4271, 31774, 25, 12748, 304, 4271, 31774, 1741, 438, 1632, 2220, 14810, 8511, 24549, 11, 8511, 36724, 11, 1501, 60307, 11, 323, 6419, 15294, 13, 4220, 525, 279, 16266, 315, 697, 45746, 323, 646, 387, 25365, 705, 476, 1495, 11649, 389, 279, 13101, 624, 19, 13, 2691, 304, 5114, 9666, 25, 2691, 304, 5114, 9666, 1741, 438, 264, 13939, 1501, 22850, 11, 5383, 