min user.\n9. Checker user rejects a task:\n\t1. User clicks "Reject" button on the task detail screen.\n\t2. System displays confirmation message.\n\t3. User clicks "Confirm" button.\n\t4. System updates the status of the task to "In Progress" and sends a notification to the Tagger user.\n\n#### Use Cases\n\n1. Admin user creates a new task:\n\t* The Admin user wants to create a new task for a Tagger user to annotate a Document Model.\n2. Admin user edits an existing task:\n\t* The Admin user wants to make changes to an existing task, such as changing the due date or re-assigning the task to a different Tagger user.\n3. DS user uploads a new Document Model:\n\t* The DS user wants to add a new Document Model to the system for annotation.\n4. Tagger user views a task:\n\t* The Tagger user wants to view the details of a task that has been assigned to them.\n5. Tagger user starts annotation on a task:\n\t* The Tagger user wants to begin the process of annotating a Document Model.\n6. Tagger user submits a task for review:\n\t* The Tagger user has completed the annotation of a Document Model and wants to submit', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [18, 13, 20578, 1196, 66563, 264, 501, 11789, 4903, 510, 197, 16, 13, 2657, 27749, 330, 13844, 11789, 4903, 1, 3137, 624, 197, 17, 13, 739, 18689, 330, 13844, 11789, 4903, 1, 1352, 624, 197, 18, 13, 2657, 49143, 1034, 311, 8135, 323, 40587, 304, 894, 2567, 11160, 5043, 624, 197, 19, 13, 2657, 27749, 330, 8890, 1, 3137, 624, 197, 20, 13, 739, 11364, 323, 10533, 279, 11789, 4903, 323, 18689, 2393, 1943, 624, 19, 13, 350, 1