foods that offer high protein and fiber."\n\n[Visual] Show a person eating a salad with lots of vegetables.\n\n[Script] "Also, make sure to include plenty of fruits and vegetables in your diet as these are high in fiber and other important nutrients."\n\n[Visual] Show a person using measuring cups to control their portion sizes.\n\n[Script] "By eating more of the right foods, you can actually boost your metabolism and lose weight more effectively. And the best part, you\'ll feel fuller and more satisfied throughout the day."\n\n[Visual] Show a person drinking a glass of water.\n\n[Script] "In addition to eating the right foods, portion control is key. Eating too much of even the healthiest foods can still lead to weight gain."\n\n[Visual] Show a person filling up a reusable water bottle.\n\n[Script] "So make sure to keep an eye on your portion sizes and aim for balanced meals that include protein, complex carbs, healthy fats, and lots of veggies."\n\n[Visual] Show a person preparing meals for the week and placing them in containers.\n\n[Script] "Planning ahead and prepping meals is also a great way to stay on track and make sure you have healthy nutrient-dense foods on hand when hunger strikes."\n\n[Visual] Show a person reaching for a piece of fruit as a healthy snack.\n\n[Script] "When you\'re in a rush or on the go, it\'s easy to reach for unhealthy snacks like chips or candy. Instead, keep healthy snacks like fruit, nuts, or veggie sticks on hand for a quick, easy, and nutritious snack."\n\n[Visual] Show a person using herbs and spices to add flavor to their cooking.\n\n[Script] "Eating healthy doesn\'t have to be boring. Experiment with different herbs', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=N