INFO 03-13 07:53:53 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-25e2a17b114d4ff0ac0300e6796cabb3-0: prompt: 'Hiring a realtor can provide a variety of benefits for those looking to buy or sell a property. Some of the most significant advantages include:\n\n1. Knowledge of the market: Realtors have a deep understanding of the local real estate market and can provide valuable insights into current market trends, pricing, and property availability. This knowledge can help buyers and sellers make more informed decisions.\n2. Access to resources: Realtors have access to a wide range of resources, including property listings, market data, and industry contacts. This access can help buyers and sellers find properties that meet their specific needs and preferences.\n3. Negotiation skills: Realtors are trained negotiators and are skilled at negotiating deals on behalf of their clients. They can help buyers and sellers get the best possible price for their property.\n4. Legal expertise: Realtors have a thorough understanding of the legal aspects of buying and selling real estate. They can help buyers and sellers navigate the complex legal process and ensure that all necessary documents are in order.\n5. Time-saving: Realtors can save their clients a significant amount of time by handling many of the tasks associated with buying or selling a property, such as scheduling viewings, showing properties, and coordinating with other professionals.\n6. Stress-free experience: The process of buying or selling a property can be stressful, but a realtor can help minimize the stress by handling many of the details and keeping their clients informed throughout the process.\n\nIn summary, hiring a realtor can provide a variety of benefits that can help buyers and sellers navigate the complex world of real estate, ensuring a smooth and successful transaction.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_