INFO 03-13 07:53:54 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-20ce18cd29b84d94afe8b06e3c8ae663-0: prompt: 'In Couchbase Server, you can check if a document exists using the Java SDK by calling the `get` method on a `Collection` object, passing in the ID of the document you want to check. The `get` method returns a `GetResult` object that contains the document content, metadata, and a boolean flag indicating whether the document exists.\n\nHere\'s an example:\n```kotlin\nval collection: Collection = // obtain a Collection object\nval documentId = "document-id"\n\ntry {\n    val getResult = collection.get(documentId)\n    // Document exists\n} catch (e: DocumentNotFoundException) {\n    // Document does not exist\n}\n```\nIn the above example, if the document with ID `"document-id"` exists, the `get` method call will return a `GetResult` object that you can use to access the document\'s content and metadata. If the document does not exist, a `DocumentNotFoundException` will be thrown, which you can catch to handle the case where the document does not exist.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [641, 61128, 3152, 8422, 11, 498, 646, 1779, 421, 264, 2197, 6724, 1667, 279, 7943, 26623, 553, 8098, 279, 1565, 455, 63, 1714, 389, 264, 1565, 6482, 63, 1633, 11, 12299, 304, 279, 3034, 315, 279, 2197, 498, 1366, 311, 1779, 13, 576, 1565, 455, 63, 1714, 4675, 264, 1565, 1949, 2077, 63, 1633, 429, 5610, 279, 2197, 2213, 11, 11160, 11, 323, 264, 2710, 5181, 18860, 3425, 279, 2197, 6724, 382, 8420, 594, 458, 3110, 510, 73594, 74, 15345, 198, 831, 4426, 25, 11101, 284, 442, 6851, 2