lf back up. She was left dangling in mid-air, her legs kicking wildly as she struggled to find her footing.\n\nThe other campers rushed to her aid, reaching out to grab her hands and pull her to safety. It was a tense and nerve-wracking moment, but they managed to hold on and pull her back to solid ground.\n\nAs they caught their breath and looked back at the bridge, they saw that it had been completely destroyed. They knew that if they had hesitated for even a moment longer, they would have all fallen to their deaths.\n\nDespite their near-death experience, the campers refused to give up. They knew that they had to find a way to escape the ghostly presence and make it back to civilization.\n\nThey continued on their way, trying to stay together and stay alert for any sign of danger. As they walked, they could feel the ghostly presence closing in around them, but they refused to give up.\n\nFinally, after what seemed like hours of walking, they saw a glimmer of light in the distance. They quickened their pace, their hearts pounding with excitement and fear.\n\nAs they emerged from the forest, they saw the lights of a nearby town shining in the distance. They had made it out alive, and they knew that they would never forget the terror they had faced in those haunted woods.\n\nBut they also knew that they had proven their strength and bravery in the face of the unknown, and that they would always be able to face any challenge that came their way.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [45, 4212, 685, 11, 37118, 11, 7607, 11, 7937, 11, 69331, 11, 323, 13809, 1030, 