INFO 03-13 07:53:58 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-cc475d287fa946859728498c44f74fe5-0: prompt: 'I apologize for the mistake, and you are correct that the condition for the win is incorrect. I will update the code to fix the condition for the win:\n```python\ndef calculate_total_score(input_data):\n    strategy_guide = input_data.split("\\n")\n    score = 0\n\n    for strategy in strategy_guide:\n        opponent_choice, your_choice = strategy.split()\n\n        # Convert the choices to numerical values: Rock (1), Paper (2), Scissors (3)\n        opponent_value = {"A": 1, "B": 2, "C": 3}[opponent_choice]\n        your_value = {"X": 1, "Y": 2, "Z": 3}[your_choice]\n\n        # Calculate the score for the current round\n        if opponent_value == your_value:\n            round_score = 3 + your_value  # Draw\n        elif (your_value - opponent_value) % 3 == 1:\n            round_score = 6 + 2 * your_value  # Win (shape score + 6)\n        else:\n            round_score = your_value  # Loss\n\n        score += round_score\n\n    return score\n\n# Read input data from the file "input.txt"\nwith open("input.txt", "r") as file:\n    input_data = file.read().strip()\n\n# Call the function with the input data read from the file\nresult = calculate_total_score(input_data)\nprint(result)\n```\nI\'ve updated the calculation of the round score for the win condition by changing `(opponent_value - your_value) % 3 == 1` to `(your_value - opponent_value) % 3 == 1`. Please try running the updated code with your input data.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [40, 36879,