INFO 03-13 07:54:01 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-39807da3577e410185a1db5a8597d6e5-0: prompt: "With that, the mirrors began to swirl and twist, and Clara and Alistair were forced to face the darkest parts of themselves. They fought and struggled, each trying to overcome their own inner demons, but it was a difficult and exhausting battle. Despite her fears, Clara pressed on, determined to reach her destination and complete her trial. As they entered the city of the gods, they were immediately struck by its beauty and majesty. The city was filled with towering temples, golden spires, and majestic statues. However, despite its beauty, Clara could sense that something was not right.\n\nAs they walked through the city, they were greeted by the inhabitants, who seemed happy and content. But Clara couldn't shake the feeling that something was off. She noticed that the people seemed to avoid looking at her and Alistair directly, and they spoke in hushed tones.\n\nAlistair tried to reassure Clara, but she could see the worry in his eyes. They continued on, making their way to the central temple of the city. As they approached, they were stopped by a group of guards. The leader of the group, a tall and imposing dark elf, demanded to know their business in the city.\n\nClara and Alistair explained that they were there to complete a trial, but the dark elf seemed unconvinced. He ordered his guards to seize them and bring them before the council of the city. Clara and Alistair were taken to a grand hall, where they were met by a council of ancient and powerful gods.\n\nThe council questioned Clara and Alistair, trying to determine their true motives. Despite their best efforts, Clara and Alistair could not convince the council of their innocence. The council accused them of being agents of the dark elves, sent to infiltrate the city and destroy it from within.\n\nClara and Alistair knew that they had to act fast. They knew that if they were unable to prove their innocence, they would be executed on the spot. Clara came up with a plan, and she and Alistair quickly put it into action.\n\nAs they fought their way out of the hall, they were pursued by the guards and the dark elf. They made their way to the central temple, where they knew the dark presence was located. As they entered the temple, they were confronted by the dark elf, who was revealed to be the source of the dark presence in the city.\n\nClara and Alistair fought bravely against the dark elf, but they were vastly outnumbered and outmatched. Just when all seemed lost, Clara was able to draw upon her inner strength and summon a powerful blast of light magic, which struck the dark elf and sent him reeling.\n\nWith the dark elf defeated, the city of the gods was saved. Clara and Alistair were hailed as heroes, and they were granted the prize for completing their trial: a powerful magic artifact that would aid them in their future battles against the dark elves.\n\nAs they left the city, Clara and Alistair knew that their journey was far from over. But they were stronger and more determined than ever, and they were ready to face whatever challenges lay ahead.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [2354, 429, 11, 279, 40485, 6009, 311, 86360, 323, 26646, 11, 323, 50557, 323, 362, 1607, 1310, 1033, 9575, 311, 3579, 279, 75969, 5479, 315, 5577, 13, 2379, 20463, 323, 27115, 11, 1817, 4460, 311, 22279, 862, 1828, 9179, 43975, 11, 714, 432, 572, 264, 5000, 323, 78853, 8049, 13, 17715, 1059, 23209, 11, 50557, 17320, 389, 11, 10838, 311, 5545, 1059, 9106, 323, 4583, 1059, 9091, 1