INFO 03-13 07:54:05 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-7af64beb50ae4a2c9a57fbf75820750e-0: prompt: "Sure, here's another story using the first person:\n\nAs a busy working professional, I was always on the go and struggling to keep up with the demands of my job. I was constantly on the phone, checking emails, and attending meetings, and I rarely had a chance to relax and unwind.\n\nOver time, the stress began to take its toll on my health and well-being. I found myself suffering from anxiety, insomnia, and a general feeling of burnout. I tried various methods to cope with my stress, from meditation to exercise, but nothing seemed to offer me the relief I needed.\n\nOne day, I stumbled upon an article about a new technology that used electrical impulses to stimulate the body's natural healing processes. Intrigued, I began researching the concept further, talking to experts in the field and trying out various devices.\n\nBut I quickly realized that there was no product on the market that was specifically designed to target the areas of the body most affected by stress and anxiety. And so, I decided to take matters into my own hands.\n\nI spent months working on a prototype of what would eventually become the anti-stress electrotherapy egg. I tested different materials and frequencies, and worked closely with experts in the field to ensure that my product was safe, effective, and easy to use.\n\nFinally, after years of hard work and dedication, I was ready to launch my product to the world. And the response was overwhelming. Today, my anti-stress electrotherapy egg has helped countless people find relief from anxiety, stress, and insomnia, and I'm proud to be able to offer a solution that can make a real difference in people's lives.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ign