INFO 03-13 07:54:05 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-400e18f47387463e9a2675c438a1d8b7-0: prompt: 'Wukong sat on his throne, his golden fur glinting in the firelight of the camp. The soldiers who had just returned from the village knelt before him, heads bowed in fear.\n\n"Why did you return without any recruits or girls?" Wukong asked, his voice cold and dangerous.\n\n"M-my lord, we encountered Macaque and MK," one of the soldiers stammered, sweat dripping down his forehead. "They brought their own army and chased us off."\n\n"Did you fight them?" Wukong demanded, his eyes blazing.\n\n"N-no, my lord," the soldier replied, his voice shaking. "We knew we were no match for Macaque without you there."\n\nWukong stood up, his body tensing with anger. "I warned you all what would happen if you failed me. I will not tolerate cowardice among my soldiers." He turned to the dark-haired monkeys forced into his army, who were watching from the sidelines. "And you, my loyal soldiers, should know better than to let these cowards return empty-handed. They will face punishment for their failure."\n\nThe soldiers cowered in fear as Wukong paced back and forth, his rage building. "I will not be defeated by Macaque," he growled. "I will find him, and I will make him pay for his treachery."\n\nHe stopped and turned to the soldiers, his eyes glowing with a dangerous light. "But first, I will deal with you."', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [54, 3101, 644, 7578, 389, 806, 43621, 11, 806, 20748, 18241, 2770, 396, 287, 304, 279, 3940, 4145, 315, 279, 3113, 13, 576, 14856, 879,