INFO 03-13 07:54:12 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-e00307dc95354e61844c8fdf346a755d-0: prompt: "Sure, here's a template for the above story:\n\nTitle: [Insert Title Here]\n\nSetting: [Insert School Setting Here]\n\nCharacter: [Insert Character Name Here]\n\n* Age:\n* Gender:\n* Disability:\n\nWord Bank:\n\n* Guide dog: a trained dog used to assist a person with a disability\n* Independent: able to do things on your own without help\n\nPlot Outline:\n\nI. Introduction\n\n* Introduce the character and their disability\n* Explain why the character needs a guide dog\n* Describe the setting and how the character interacts with it\n\nII. Rising Action\n\n* Describe the character's struggles with the guide dog\n* Show how the character becomes more independent with the guide dog's help\n* Show how the guide dog helps the character navigate the school setting\n\nIII. Climax\n\n* Describe a moment of conflict or danger for the character and the guide dog\n* Show how the character and the guide dog work together to overcome the obstacle\n\nIV. Falling Action\n\n* Show how the character's life has improved with the guide dog's assistance\n* Describe how the character has become more independent and confident\n\nV. Conclusion\n\n* Wrap up the story and reflect on the character's journey\n* Emphasize the importance of guide dogs and the independence they can provide for people with disabilities\n\nVocabulary List:\n\n* Guide dog: a trained dog used to assist a person with a disability\n* Independent: able to do things on your own without help\n* Disability: a physical or mental condition that limits a person's movements, senses, or activities", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_token