INFO 03-13 07:54:15 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-51c53718c37e4912acacfd57ec56b679-0: prompt: 'Sure, you can modify the regular expression to match either the full file path or a partial file path by using a non-capturing group with an optional forward slash before the first capturing group like this:\n```regex\n/(?:(?<=\\/)|^)(?<pn>\\d{4,9})\\/(?<type>LA|LSt|LS|SV)_(?<year>\\d{4})(_(?<month>\\d{2}))?_(?<pn2>\\d{4,9})(_(?<version>\\d{2}))?.pdf$/\n```\nThis modified regular expression includes a non-capturing group `(?:...)` with a positive lookbehind `(?<=...)` for a forward slash (`/`) followed by the start of the string anchor `^`. This allows the regular expression to match the first capturing group whether it is preceded by a forward slash or not.\n\nHere is a breakdown of the modified regular expression:\n\n* `/(?:(?<=\\/)|^)` - Non-capturing group with a positive lookbehind for a forward slash or start of string anchor\n* `(?<pn>\\d{4,9})\\/` - First capturing group for a sequence of 4 to 9 digits followed by a forward slash\n* `(?<type>LA|LSt|LS|SV)` - Second capturing group for the allowed values LA, LSt, LS, or SV\n* `_(?<year>\\d{4})` - Third capturing group for a sequence of 4 digits following an underscore\n* `(_(?<month>\\d{2}))?` - Optional fourth capturing group for a sequence of 2 digits following an underscore, preceded by another underscore\n* `_(?<pn2>\\d{4,9})` - Fifth capturing group for a sequence of 4 to 9 digits following an underscore\n* `(_(?<version>\\d{2}))?` - Optional sixth capturing group for a sequence of 2 digits following an underscore, preceded by another underscore\n* `\\.pdf$/` - Required suffix for a file extension of .pdf at the end of the string\n\nThis modified regular expression should match both full file paths and partial file paths that include the first capturing group with a sequence of 4 to 9 digits followed by a forward slash. I hope this helps! Let me know if you have any further questions or concerns.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [39814, 11, 498, 646, 5602, 279, 5792, 7493, 311, 2432, 2987, 279, 2480, 1034, 1815, 476, 264, 7130, 1034, 1815, 553, 1667, 264, 2477, 1786, 2689, 1677, 1874, 448, 458, 10101, 4637, 36626, 1573, 279, 1156, 39780, 1874, 1075, 419, 510, 73594, 26387, 198, 53780, 3269, 30, 8203, 4739, 17935, 61, 2376, 75414, 19958, 8449, 67, 90, 19, 11, 24, 5410, 4739, 33294, 27, 1313, 29, 17845, 91, 43, 623, 91, 7268, 91, 17803, 8, 8361, 75414, 3157, 8449, 67, 90, 19, 31888, 8361, 75414, 10249, 8449, 67, 90, 17, 65305, 30, 8361, 75414, 19958, 17, 8449, 67, 90, 19, 11, 24, 31888, 8361, 75414, 4366, 8449, 67, 90, 17, 65305, 4607, 11828, 3, 5894, 13874, 3989, 1986, 10807, 5792, 7493, 5646, 264, 2477, 1786, 2689, 1677, 1874, 48651, 4820, 32574, 63, 448, 264, 6785, 1401, 29898, 484, 1565, 33294, 8203, 32574, 63, 369, 264, 4637, 36626, 28654, 14, 32881, 8110, 553, 279, 1191, 315, 279, 914, 17105, 1565, 61, 28587, 1096, 6147, 279, 5792, 7493, 311, 2432, 279, 1156, 39780, 1874, 3425, 432, 374, 52480, 553, 264, 4637, 36626, 476, 537, 382, 8420, 374, 264, 29985, 315, 279, 10807, 5792, 7493, 1447, 9, 1565, 53780, 3269, 30, 8203, 4739, 17935, 61, 46186, 481, 11581, 1786, 2689, 1677, 1874, 448, 264, 6785, 1401, 29898, 484, 369, 264, 4637, 36626, 476, 1191, 315, 914, 17105, 198, 9, 1565, 33294, 27, 19958, 8449, 67, 90, 19, 11, 24, 5410, 4739, 63, 481, 5512, 39780, 1874, 369, 264, 8500, 315, 220, 19, 311, 220, 24, 18509, 8110, 553, 264, 4637, 36626, 198, 9, 1565, 33294, 27, 1313, 29, 17845, 91, 43, 623, 91, 7268, 91, 17803, 46186, 481, 10440, 39780, 1874, 369, 279,