INFO 03-13 07:54:18 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-7311982bdd95446d9d1e219862428669-0: prompt: 'This is a PHP class that extends the CodeIgniter Model class. The class defines a function called "loop" which is used to retrieve and process data from Wordpress posts. The function takes two parameters, "post\\_options" and "type", which are used to specify the criteria for which posts to retrieve, and the format of the retrieved data, respectively.\n\nThe function uses the WP\\_Query class to retrieve posts that match the specified criteria, and then loops through the retrieved posts, extracting various information such as the post\'s title, content, date, category, and authors. Some of this information is then processed further, such as stripping "more" links from the content, and hardcoding the post\'s permalink to point to the blog URL. If the post has a featured image, it is also retrieved, and may be resized depending on the value of the "type" parameter. All of the extracted information is then stored in an array called "posts", which is returned by the function.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [1986, 374, 264, 13119, 536, 429, 2239, 279, 6119, 43337, 2015, 4903, 536, 13, 576, 536, 18653, 264, 729, 2598, 330, 10498, 1, 892, 374, 1483, 311, 17179, 323, 1882, 821, 504, 88069, 7999, 13, 576, 729, 4990, 1378, 5029, 11, 330, 2203, 75738, 2875, 1, 323, 330, 1313, 497, 892, 525, 1483, 311, 13837, 279, 12890, 369, 892, 7999, 311, 17179, 11, 323, 279, 3561, 315, 279, 30403, 821, 11, 15576, 382, 785, 729, 5711, 279, 23253, 75738, 2859, 536, 311, 17179, 7999