INFO 03-13 07:54:22 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-28e3153a56f24c9d9252a2bdcfb52533-0: prompt: 'Sure, here are 5 more tips for an empath/HSP nurse to counsel children\'s emotional struggles:\n\n1. Practice grounding techniques: As an empath/HSP, you may be more susceptible to taking on the emotional energy of others. Practice grounding techniques such as deep breathing, meditation, or spending time in nature to help you stay centered and focused.\n2. Use non-judgmental language: Avoid using language that can be perceived as judgmental or dismissive, such as "just relax" or "stop worrying." Instead, use non-judgmental language that acknowledges the child\'s emotions and validates their experience.\n3. Incorporate sensory input: As an HSP, sensory input can have a powerful impact on your emotional state. Consider incorporating sensory input such as aromatherapy or calming music into your counseling sessions to help create a calming environment for both you and the child.\n4. Develop a self-care plan: As an empath/HSP, self-care is especially important. Develop a self-care plan that includes regular breaks, time for quiet reflection, and activities that bring you joy.\n5. Seek support: Counseling children\'s emotional struggles can be emotionally challenging, even for the most experienced nurses. Seek support from colleagues, supervisors, or a therapist to help you manage your own emotional needs while also providing support to the children in your care.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [39814, 11, 1588, 525, 220, 20, 803, 10414, 369, 458, 35581, 23354, 