and Japan\'s emerging e-commerce market. Western Europe leads e-commerce sales, with cosmetics as the most consumed market. Zoom Market, headquartered in Latvia and sold in over 100 countries, recently opened in Market Plus and is a rising star in Europe, with more than 200 Korean sellers already on board. The GMV in Korea grew four times, with footwear and fashion categories showing a 10-fold increase and health and beauty category showing a 235% growth in 2022 compared to 21. Two successful sellers share their experiences selling on Zoom in Europe. The first seller, from \'The Real K-Beauty\', switched to online sales due to COVID-19 and chose to enter the European market through Zoom. They focused on creating high-resolution images and detailed product descriptions to increase trust with buyers, used sales strategies such as selling bundled products, and took advantage of marketing features such as subscription discounts and celebrity promotions to drive shop and product traffic. They also gave samples and attached discount coupons to increase repeat visits. The second seller, from Patrick, sells K-pop albums and goods and registered new products quickly ahead of the K-pop fan community. They used sturdy packaging, competitive pricing, and additional gifts to increase conversion rates, and utilized subscription discounts and seller promotions to increase product exposure. They also benefited from customer service supported by Zoom and received account management and marketing-related consultations from their manager. Both sellers found success on Zoom and recommend it as a platform for expanding overseas. Zoom\'s success can be attributed to its seamless logistics system, multi-language support, and efficient communication with customers. Cafe 24 Multimall sellers can enter the Zoom Market with minimal requirements and avail a 7% discount on sales commission for the first 3 months. Naver\'s My Smart Store is set to disrupt the Japanese e-commerce market with its low commission rates, synchronization with Line account, and free promotional messaging. Cafe 24 store sellers can use My Smart Store starter package app to enter the platform with the assistance of a dedicated account manager. FGS Partner Cooperation Team is actively seeking partners for expanding sellers\' sales channels and improving shopping mall operations. For inquiries, leave a message to the team.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [5501, 1281, 279, 2213, 315, 508, 32, 60, 2878, 220, 18, 15, 15, 15, 5766, 4092, 311, 279, 1352, 3685, 382, 58, 627, 921, 3851, 320, 19237, 315, 1887, 8544, 315, 2213, 304, 825, 11652, 340, 5009, 320, 64, 11652, 429, 15885, 279, 6006, 315, 279, 4549, 11, 25021, 1128, 279, 9115, 14602, 315, 279, 2213, 374, 340, 3136, 11412, 220, 16, 320, 603, 11652, 311, 3535, 279, 2213, 315, 330, 42165, 220, 16, 1138, 42165, 220, 16, 320, 4798, 429, 14758, 279, 2213, 5435, 311, 330, 1966, 11412, 220, 16, 3263, 7292, 1671, 315, 518, 3245, 1378, 42643, 340, 3136, 11412, 220, 17, 320, 603, 11652, 311, 3535, 279, 2213, 315, 330, 42165, 220, 17, 1138, 42165, 220, 17, 320, 4798, 25021, 279, 8794, 5435, 311, 330, 1966, 11412, 220, 17, 3263, 7292, 1671, 315, 518, 3245, 1378, 42643, 340, 3136, 11412, 220, 18, 320, 603, 11652, 429, 40155, 279, 2213, 315, 330, 42165, 220, 18, 1138, 42165, 220, 18, 320, 4798, 429, 14758, 279, 2213, 5435, 311, 330, 1966, 11412, 220, 18, 3263, 7292, 1671, 315, 518, 3245, 1378, 42643, 692, 63680, 2573, 279, 1372, 315, 1186, 1983, 819, 323, 42643, 4092, 311, 279, 2266, 315, 362, 382, 27814, 7088, 22519, 921, 12001, 50, 31