INFO 03-13 07:54:29 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-9a4df0eac96d43f09d6e800be3a0e1e2-0: prompt: 'Here is a continuation of the hypothetical scenario featuring the characters Jerry, Kramer, and Elaine from the TV show Seinfeld, with a description of the varieties of pests that Newman\'s parents brought into his apartment:\n\nNewman: *sighs in frustration* "This is not a solution, Mom, Dad. You\'re not helping. You\'re just making things worse. Please, stop and listen to me."\n\nBut Newman\'s parents are convinced that they are helping and refuse to listen to his protest. They ignore his pleas and continue to release more pests into his apartment, thinking that they are solving the problem and making his life easier.\n\nNewman\'s Dad: *looks around apartment* "Look, Newman. The pests are already working. The trash is disappearing and your apartment is looking cleaner and fresher. You should thank us."\n\nNewman: *groans* "I can\'t believe this is happening. Mom, Dad, please stop. These pests are not a solution. They\'re going to cause more problems and create more mess. I don\'t want them in my apartment."\n\nNewman\'s Mom: *smiles* "Don\'t worry, Newman. These pests are specially trained and will only eat trash and waste. They won\'t bother you or cause any harm. They\'re here to help and make your life easier."\n\nAs Newman\'s parents continue to release more pests into his apartment, he can see that they come in various shapes and sizes. There are small, wriggling worms that crawl through the trash, eating everything in their path. There are larger, six-legged insects with powerful mandibles that can devour larger pieces of waste and debris. And there are even larger, more formidable creatures with sharp teeth and armored exoskeletons, ready to take on the most stubborn and difficult bits of garbage.\n\nNewman watches in horror as the pests consume everything in their path, turning his once tidy and clean apartment into a writhing mass of trash and debris. He knows that this is not a solution, but no one will listen to him or take him seriously. He is left feeling helpless and defeated, with no means of stopping the pests or reversing the damage that has been done. He can only hope that he can find a way to get rid of the pests and restore his apartment to its former state, but he knows that it will be a long and difficult process.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [8420, 374, 264, 41171, 315, 279, 58059, 15048, 16445, 279, 5766, 28708, 11, 89477, 11, 323, 82147, 504, 279, 5883, 1473, 1345, 98836, 11, 448, 264, 4008, 315, 279, 35580, 315, 74956, 429, 55621, 594, 6562, 7117, 1119, 806, 13154, 1447, 3564, 1515, 25, 353, 82, 1090, 82, 304, 31986, 9, 330, 1986, 374, 537, 264, 6291, 11, 22180, 11, 32521, 13, 1446, 2299, 537, 10476, 13, 1446, 2299, 1101, 3259, 2513, 10960, 13, 5209, 11, 2936, 323, 8844, 311, 752, 2217, 3983, 55621, 594, 6562, 525, 22166, 429, 807, 525, 10476, 323, 25066, 311, 8844, 311, 806, 8665, 13, 2379, 10034, 806, 87700, 323, 3060, 311, 4879, 803, 74956, 1119, 806, 13154, 11, 7274, 429, 807, 525, 21828, 279, 3491, 323, 3259, 806, 2272, 8661, 382, 3564, 1515, 594, 32521, 25, 353, 94273, 2163, 13154, 9, 330, 10380, 11, 55621, 13, 576, 74956, 525, 2669, 3238, 13, 576, 22854, 374, 66403, 323, 697, 13154, 374, 3330, 31881, 323, 48873, 1923, 13, 1446, 1265, 9702, 601, 2217, 3564, 1515, 25, 353, 41411, 596, 9, 330, 40, 646, 944, 4411, 419, 374, 12482, 13, 22180, 11, 32521, 11, 4486, 2936, 13, 4220, 74956, 525, 537, 264, 6291, 13, 2379, 2299, 2087, 311, 5240, 803, 5322, 323, 1855, 803, 9435, 13, 358, 1513