INFO 03-13 07:54:32 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-52d62137836540988f727ad077851277-0: prompt: 'Here are some potential ideas for a final project involving image deraining:\n\n1. Multi-Modal Image Deraining: Develop a deep learning-based model that can remove rain streaks from images captured under different weather conditions, such as fog, haze, or snow. You can collect your own dataset or use publicly available datasets, such as Rain100H, Foggy Cityscapes, or RESIDE.\n2. Video Deraining: Develop a deep learning-based model that can remove rain streaks from videos. You can use a combination of spatiotemporal convolutions and attention mechanisms to capture the spatial and temporal dependencies in the video. You can train the model on publicly available datasets, such as Rain100H, Rain100L, or DAVIS.\n3. Adversarial Training for Image Deraining: Use adversarial training to develop a deep learning-based model that can remove rain streaks from images while preserving image details and structures. You can use a combination of adversarial loss, perceptual loss, and content loss to train the model. You can train the model on publicly available datasets, such as Rain100H, Rain100L, or RESIDE.\n4. Domain Adaptation for Image Deraining: Develop a deep learning-based model that can remove rain streaks from images captured in different domains, such as synthetic data and real-world data. You can use domain adaptation techniques, such as adversarial domain adaptation or style transfer, to adapt the model to different domains. You can train the model on publicly available datasets, such as Rain100H, Rain100L, or GTA5.\n5. Hybrid Methods for Image Deraining: Develop a hybrid method that combines deep learning-based approaches with classical image processing techniques, such as spatial filtering or frequency analysis. You can explore different combinations of deep learning-based and classical methods and evaluate their performance on publicly available datasets, such as Rain100H, Rain100L, or RESIDE.\n\nThese are just a few potential ideas for a final project involving image deraining. The specific project will depend on the interests and expertise of the student, as well as the available resources and time constraints. The project should also involve a clear problem statement, a well-defined methodology, and a comprehensive evaluation of the results.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [8420, 525, 1045, 4650, 6708, 369, 264, 1590, 2390, 15860, 2168, 2694, 2056, 1447, 16, 13, 17439, 12, 8080, 4654, 12741, 2056, 25, 7843, 264, 5538, 6832, 5980, 1614, 429, 646, 4057, 11174, 29214, 82, 504, 5335, 17006, 1212, 2155, 9104, 4682, 11, 1741, 438, 30249, 11, 89309, 11, 476, 11794, 13, 1446, 646, 6530, 697, 1828, 10337, 476, 990, 17424, 2500, 29425, 11, 1741, 438, 21911, 16, 15, 15, 39, 11, 58148, 4577, 4311, 2388, 9337, 11, 476, 13170, 12146, 624, 17, 13, 8354, 12741, 2056, 25, 7843, 264, 5538, 6832, 5980, 1614, 429, 646, 4057, 11174, 29214, 82, 504, 6803, 13, 1446, 646, 990, 264, 10601, 315, 978, 9307, 354, 3262, 9819, 5686, 20201, 323, 6529, 23783, 311, 12322, 279, 27979, 323, 35915, 19543, 304, 279, 2766, 13, 1446, 646, 5426, 279, 1614, 389, 17424, 2500, 29425, 11, 1741, 438, 21911, 16, 15, 15, 39, 11, 21911, 16, 15, 15, 43, 11, 476, 422, 98716, 624, 18, 13, 2410, 3004, 42721, 16151, 369, 4654, 12741, 2056, 25, 5443, 28411, 42721, 4862, 311, 2225, 264, 5538, 6832, 5980, 1614, 429, 646, 4057, 11174, 29214, 82, 504, 5335, 1393, 46895, 2168, 3565, 323, 14389, 13, 1446, 646, 990, 264, 10601, 315, 28411, 42721, 4709, 11, 77532, 928, 4709, 