e holding onto past hurts or resentments.\n\nPractical Advice: Practice forgiveness towards yourself and your partner. Seek therapy or healing practices to help you overcome any emotional wounds.\n\n1. Take Responsibility: Seeing 212 in relation to relationships is a message to take responsibility for your role in your relationship. You may be blaming your partner for issues in your relationship.\n\nPractical Advice: Practice self-reflection and take responsibility for your actions. Communicate openly with your partner and practice mutual respect.\n\n1. Embrace Differences: Seeing 212 in relation to relationships is a message to embrace the differences in your relationship. You may be struggling with differences in personality or interests.\n\nPractical Advice: Practice compromise and embrace each other's differences. Show curiosity and interest towards your partner's passions and hobbies.\n\n1. Work on Self-Improvement: Seeing 212 in relation to relationships is a message to work on self-improvement in your relationship. You may be neglecting your own growth and development.\n\nPractical Advice: Prioritize self-care and work on improving yourself. Communicate your goals with your partner and practice mutual support.\n\n1. Prioritize Intimacy: Seeing 212 in relation to relationships is a message to prioritize intimacy in your relationship. You may be neglecting physical or emotional intimacy with your partner.\n\nPractical Advice: Practice communication and express your needs and desires with your partner. Prioritize quality time together and show affection through small gestures and acts of kindness.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tok