INFO 03-13 07:54:41 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-a308bbffe1b6464e8c193b4bb2b5cc7c-0: prompt: 'You are correct that the `decodeFile()` method can throw a `FileNotFoundException` if the file specified by the path does not exist.\nYou can handle this by using try-catch block like this:\n```\ntry {\n    val bitmap = BitmapFactory.decodeFile(output.savedUri.path)\n    val newBitmap = Bitmap.createBitmap(bitmap.width, bitmap.height, bitmap.config)\n    val canvas = Canvas(newBitmap)\n    canvas.drawBitmap(bitmap, 0f, 0f, null)\n    canvas.drawText(text, 0f, 0f, paint)\n    val newFile = File(output.savedUri.path)\n    val outputStream = FileOutputStream(newFile)\n    newBitmap.compress(Bitmap.CompressFormat.JPEG, 100, outputStream)\n    outputStream.close()\n    viewBinding.viewFinder.post { viewBinding.viewFinder.setImageBitmap(newBitmap) }\n} catch (e: FileNotFoundException) {\n    Log.e(TAG, "File not found: ${e.message}")\n}\n```\nBy doing this, you can handle the exception and prevent the app from crashing if the file specified by the path does not exist. You can also add a log message to print the error message if the exception is caught.\n\nAdditionally, you can also check whether the `bitmap` is null before doing any operation on it.\n```\nval bitmap = BitmapFactory.decodeFile(output.savedUri.path)\nif(bitmap != null){\n    val newBitmap = Bitmap.createBitmap(bitmap.width, bitmap.height, bitmap.config)\n    val canvas = Canvas(newBitmap)\n    canvas.drawBitmap(bitmap, 0f, 0f, null)\n    canvas.drawText(text, 0f, 0f, paint)\n    val newFile = File(output.savedUri.path)\n    val outputStream = FileOutputStream(newFile)\n    newBitmap.compress(Bitmap.CompressFormat.JPEG, 100, outputStream)\n    outputStream.close()\n    viewBinding.viewFinder.post { viewBinding.viewFinder.setImageBitmap(newBitmap) }\n} else {\n    Log.e(TAG, "Bitmap is null")\n}\n```\nThis will prevent the app from crashing if the bitmap is null and print a log message indicating the bitmap is null.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [2610, 525, 4396, 429, 279, 1565, 18196, 1703, 54258, 1714, 646, 2510, 264, 1565, 64691, 63, 421, 279, 1034, 5189, 553, 279, 1815, 1558, 537, 3000, 624, 2610, 646, 3705, 419, 553, 1667, 1430, 1786, 754, 2504, 1075, 419, 510, 13874, 3989, 1539, 341, 262, 1044, 19746, 284, 69896, 15922, 1703, 11057, 81346, 13899, 3875, 340, 262, 1044, 501, 16773, 284, 17533, 2520, 16773, 54378, 5441, 11, 19746, 5727, 11, 19746, 5423, 340, 262, 1044, 10041, 284, 25698, 1755, 16773, 340, 262, 10041, 7007, 16773, 54378, 11, 220, 15, 69, 11, 220, 15, 69, 11, 845, 340, 262, 10041, 88565, 7235, 11, 220, 15, 69, 11, 220, 15, 69, 11, 6177, 340, 262, 1044, 501, 1703, 284, 2887, 11057, 81346, 13899, 3875, 340, 262, 1044, 57961, 284, 42656, 1755, 1703, 340, 262, 501, 16773, 81686, 57574, 2961, 1873, 4061, 3503, 22061, 11, 220, 16, 15, 15, 11, 57961, 340, 262, 57961, 4653, 741, 262, 1651, 15059, 3792, 42300, 6542, 314, 1651, 15059, 3792, 42300, 94977, 1755, 16773, 8, 456, 92, 2287, 320, 68, 25, 68299, 8, 341, 262, 2835, 1734, 15989, 11, 330, 1703, 537, 1730, 25, 3570, 68, 6698, 14451, 532, 13874, 3989, 1359, 3730, 419, 11, 498, 646, 3705, 279, 4683, 323, 5358, 279, 906, 504, 45474, 421, 279, 1034, 5189, 553, 279, 1815, 1558, 537, 3000, 13, 1446, 646, 1083, 912, 264, 1487, 1943, 311, 1173, 279, 1465, 1943, 421, 279, 4683, 374, 10568, 382, 49574, 11, 498, 646, 1083, 1779, 3425, 279, 1565, 40954, 63, 374, 845, 1573, 3730, 894, 5666, 389, 432, 624, 13874, 3989, 831, 19746, 284, 69896, 15922, 1703, 11057, 81346, 13899, 3875, 340, 333, 54378, 961, 845, 