INFO 03-13 07:54:49 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-0db843f25e9143209be01bff612ce3f8-0: prompt: "I apologize for the confusion. It seems that the 'similarity' variable might not be properly assigned in the 'submitAnswer()' function.\n\nPlease replace the 'submitAnswer()' function in the 'index.html' file with the following updated version:\n```javascript\nfunction submitAnswer() {\n    const userWord = $('#user-word').val();\n    $.ajax({\n        url: '/calculate-similarity',\n        method: 'POST',\n        data: {\n            user_word: userWord,\n            result_embedding: JSON.stringify(currentPuzzle.result_embedding)\n        },\n        success: function(data) {\n            if (data.error) {\n                $('#result').text(data.error);\n            } else {\n                if (data.is_correct) {\n                    let points = 0;\n                    if (timeLeft > 25) {\n                        points = 3;\n                    } else if (timeLeft > 20) {\n                        points = 2;\n                    } else {\n                        points = 1;\n                    }\n                    points *= streakMultiplier;\n                    currentScore += points;\n                    streakMultiplier += 0.1;\n                    $('#result').text(`Correct! Points: ${points.toFixed(2)}`);\n                } else {\n                    $('#result').text('Incorrect');\n                    streakMultiplier = 1;\n                }\n                $('#score').text(`Your WordCell Score: ${currentScore.toFixed(2)}`);\n                addToHistory(currentPuzzle, userWord, data.similarity, data.nearest_neighbor_word);\n            }\n            $('#user-word').val('');\n            generatePuzzle();\n            resetTimer();\n        },\n    });\n}\n```\nThis should resolve the issue with the 'similarity' being undefined.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p