, locations | Messaging, encryption, groups | 7 |\n| Discord | 150 million | Gamers, Gen Z and millennials | Voice and text chat, communities | 5 |\n| Twitch | 140 million | Gamers, Gen Z and millennials | Live streaming, gaming content | 5 |\n| Clubhouse | 10 million | Early adopters, thought leaders | Audio chat, networking | 3 |\n\nNote: The size (monthly active users) and demographics are just estimates and can vary based on various sources. The priority score is calculated based on the importance of the social media platform for the global launch strategy, with 1 being the lowest priority and 10 being the highest priority.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [39814, 11, 1588, 594, 264, 1965, 3561, 369, 279, 1895, 315, 1429, 5411, 476, 7772, 3590, 3687, 15409, 448, 44677, 2022, 6172, 369, 3644, 7050, 1447, 91, 9784, 7816, 17458, 760, 8478, 320, 72007, 9905, 14627, 8, 760, 4724, 44145, 760, 6944, 5309, 13522, 760, 31920, 18115, 9248, 91, 12448, 760, 12448, 760, 12448, 760, 12448, 760, 12448, 9248, 91, 5573, 760, 220, 17, 13, 24, 7094, 760, 2009, 16639, 11, 81328, 11, 10468, 760, 2410, 24132, 11, 5545, 11, 19805, 760, 220, 24, 9248, 91, 13370, 760, 220, 17, 7094, 760, 2009, 16639, 11, 81328, 11, 10468, 760, 8354, 2213, 11, 2711, 25262, 760, 220, 23, 9248, 91, 40013, 760, 220, 17, 7094, 760, 2009, 16639, 11, 81328, 11, 10468, 760, 73170, 11, 1874, 48526, 11, 25463, 760, 220, 22, 9248, 91, 13991, 760, 220, 16, 13, 17, 7094, 760, 220, 16, 23, 12, 18, 19, 1042, 78473, 11, 8778, 40543, 760, 20185, 2213, 11, 6653, 19529, 8493, 760, 220, 22, 9248, 91, 72742, 52854