INFO 03-13 07:54:51 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-28e563e94b794dc3ad0076f0e3364b6c-0: prompt: "While the CV presents the candidate's strong background in project management, architecture, and leadership, there are certain areas where it may be lacking, particularly when targeting the high-tech industry:\n\n1. Specific high-tech industry experience: The CV doesn't showcase any direct experience working in the high-tech industry, which might be a concern for some recruiters.\n2. Technical skills relevant to high-tech industry: Although the candidate has a solid set of technical skills for an architect, they lack specific technical skills that are often valued in the high-tech industry, such as programming languages, data analysis tools, or product management software (e.g., Jira, Asana, Trello).\n3. Quantifiable achievements: The CV could benefit from more quantifiable achievements to demonstrate the candidate's impact on previous projects, such as cost savings, shortened timelines, or improved efficiency.\n4. Familiarity with Agile methodologies: The CV doesn't mention any experience or knowledge of Agile methodologies, which are commonly used in the high-tech industry for project and product management.\n5. Certifications or additional training: The candidate doesn't list any certifications or additional training related to project management (e.g., PMP, Scrum Master) or the high-tech industry, which could make their application more competitive.\n\nTo address these gaps, the candidate might consider:\n\n1. Gaining relevant experience through internships, freelance projects, or volunteering in the high-tech industry.\n2. Acquiring specific technical skills that are relevant to the targeted roles, such as learning a programming language, data analysis tools, or familiarizing themselves with product management software.\n3. Pursuing certifications or additional training in project management methodologies or other relevant fields for the high-tech industry.\n4. Highlighting any transferable skills from their architectural background that could be applicable to the high-tech sector, such as using design thinking, working with data, or developing digital solutions.\n5. Networking with professionals in the high-tech industry and attending industry events to gain insights and make connections that could lead to job opportunities.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [7983, 279, 14165, 18404, 279, 9144, 594, 3746, 4004, 304, 2390, 6240, 11, 17646, 11, 323, 11438, 11, 1052, 525, 3654, 5671, 1380, 432, 1231, 387, 31061, 11, 7945, 979, 24132, 279, 1550, 41257, 4958, 1447, 16, 13, 28262, 1550, 41257, 4958, 3139, 25, 576, 14165, 3171, 944, 34783, 894, 2118, 3139, 3238, 304, 279, 1550, 41257, 4958, 11, 892, 2578, 387, 264, 4643, 369, 1045, 92840, 624, 17, 13, 26668, 7361, 9760, 311, 1550, 41257, 4958, 25, 10328, 279, 9144, 702, 264, 6437, 738, 315, 10916, 7361, 369, 458, 11470, 11, 807, 6853, 3151, 10916, 7361, 429, 525, 3545, 32547, 304, 279, 1550, 41257, 4958, 11, 1741, 438, 15473, 15459, 11, 821, 6358, 7375, 11, 476, 1985, 6240, 3162, 320, 68, 1302, 2572, 619, 8832, 11, 1634, 3362, 11, 350, 74133, 4292, 18, 13, 31441, 22619, 32897, 25, 576, 14165, 1410, 8760, 504, 803, 10272, 22619, 32897, 311, 19869, 279, 9144, 594, 5421, 389, 3681, 7079, 11, 1741, 438, 2783, 18986, 11, 65563, 87144, 11, 476, 12944, 15024, 624, 19, 13, 33601, 9538, 487, 448, 82184, 80798, 25, 576, 14165, 3171, 944, 6286, 894, 3139, 476, 6540, 315, 82184, 80798, 11, 892, 525, 16626, 1483, 304, 279, 1550, 41257, 4958, 369, 2390, 323, 1985, 6240, 624, 20, 13, 