INFO 03-13 07:54:51 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-ee40902c2209451388fd84924c771bcd-0: prompt: "Sure, here's a user interview script for the Weather Travel App:\n\nIntroduction:\nHello, thank you for taking the time to speak with us today. We're working on a new mobile app called Weather Travel that helps users find destinations for their next vacation based on their preferred weather conditions and travel dates. We'd love to hear about your travel experiences and get your feedback on our app.\n\n1. Can you tell us about your travel experiences in the past? What types of destinations have you visited and why?\n2. How do you typically plan your vacations? Do you have a set process or do you like to explore different options?\n3. How do you decide where to travel to next? What factors do you consider?\n4. Have you ever used a travel app before? If so, which one(s) and what did you like or dislike about them?\n5. Let's say you're planning a vacation for next month and you want to go somewhere warm and sunny. How would you typically go about finding a destination that meets your preferences?\n6. If you were to use the Weather Travel app, what features would be most important to you? Would you prefer to search for destinations based on weather conditions, activities, or a combination of both?\n7. How important is price when it comes to selecting a travel destination? Would you be more likely to choose a destination that offers travel deals or promotions?\n8. How important is social media when it comes to sharing your travel experiences with friends and family? Would you be interested in sharing your experiences through the Weather Travel app?\n9. What challenges or frustrations have you experienced when planning your travels in the past? How do you think the Weather Travel app could address these challenges?\n10. Lastly, is there anything else you'd like to share with us about your travel preferences or experiences? Any additional feedback or suggestions for the Weather Travel app?\n\nThank you so much for your time and feedback! We really appreciate it and will take your insights into account as we continue to develop the Weather Travel app.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [39814, 11, 1588, 594, 264, 1196, 7128, 5316, 369, 279, 22629, 18097, 1845, 1447, 37155, 510, 9707, 11, 9702, 498, 369, 4633, 279, 882, 311, 6468, 448, 601, 3351, 13, 1205, 2299, 3238, 389, 264, 501, 6371, 906, 2598, 22629, 18097, 429, 8609, 3847, 1477, 33105, 369, 862, 1790, 20161, 3118, 389, 862, 14890, 9104, 4682, 323, 5821, 12713, 13, 1205, 4172, 2948, 311, 6723, 911, 697, 5821, 11449, 323, 633, 697, 11055, 389, 1039, 906, 382, 16, 13, 2980, 498, 3291, 601, 911, 697, 5821, 11449, 304, 279, 3267, 30, 3555, 4494, 315, 33105, 614, 498, 11994, 323, 3170, 5267, 17, 13, 2585, 653, 498, 11136, 3119, 697, 74567, 30, 3155, 498, 614, 264, 738, 1882, 476, 653, 498, 1075, 311, 13186, 2155, 2606, 5267, 18, 13, 2585, 653, 498, 10279, 1380, 311, 5821, 311, 1790, 30, 3555, 9363, 653, 498, 2908, 5267, 19, 13, 12243, 498, 3512, 1483, 264, 5821, 906, 1573, 30, 1416, 773, 11, 892, 825, 1141, 8, 323, 1128, 1521, 498, 1075, 476, 47869, 911, 1105, 5267, 20, 13, 6771, 594, 1977, 498, 2299, 9115, 264, 20161, 369, 1790, 2254, 323, 498, 1366, 311, 728, 14696, 8205, 323, 39698, 13, 2585, 1035, 498, 11136, 728, 911, 9271, 264, 9106, 429, 20027, 697, 19322, 5267, 21, 13, 1416, 498, 1033, 311, 990, 279, 22629, 18097, 906, 11, 1128, 4419, 1035, 387, 1429, 2989, 311, 498, 30, 18885, 498, 10702, 311, 2711, 369, 33105, 3118, 389, 9104, 4682, 11, 7488, 11, 476, 264, 10601, 315,