INFO 03-13 07:54:54 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-b48ef43e2a2c41b8bf64a2af84d8e138-0: prompt: 'Here is the updated outline incorporating the revised Act 1:\n\nTitle: Zona Norte\n\nAct 1:\n\n1. Introduction to the dystopian world of Tijuana, Mexico in 2060, focusing on the impact of the Second Mexican-American War and the rise of the authoritarian state.\n2. Establish the societal hierarchy, with cyborgs at the top and disabled individuals at the bottom.\n3. Introduce the protagonist, Alex Bravo, a disabled war veteran working at a seedy nightclub, Bar La Carreta.\n4. Show Alex\'s friendship with Lana Umbrana, a femme fatale and exotic dancer, and Jericho, another disabled war veteran.\n5. Lana finishes up a pole dance set and gives Alex a friendly acknowledgement as she is helped off the stage by male and female patrons.\n6. Lana walks off toward a table filled with three mercenary patrons (Tom, Chuck, Jenna), and Alex sighs, "If only she had no legs." Moments later, Lana is harassed by the mercenaries.\n7. Alex reluctantly and politely intervenes but is forced to get physical, quickly beating the mercenaries. Alex\'s heroics impress Gustavo, who witnesses Alex getting reprimanded and fired from the bar.\n8. Lana connects Alex with the arms broker, Gustavo Espinoza.\n9. Gustavo offers Alex cyborg legs and outdated quantum firmware in exchange for taking on a mission to track down, access, and steal the firmware and codebase to the latest quantum software.\n10. Jericho is accidentally killed by a mass transit vehicle owned by AzureSoft, triggering Alex\'s desire for justice.\n\nAct 2:\n\n1. Alex accepts the mission from Gustavo and begins his investigation.\n2. Alex learns about the SCAM technology and its potential impact on society.\n3. Tom, Chuck, and Jenna recognize Alex as the soldier that saved their lives during the war, and they befriend him.\n4. Alex discovers that his missing wife, Jessica Bravo, was working on the SCAM technology before her disappearance.\n5. Alex and his newfound allies infiltrate the Amedeira Corporation to steal the SCAM technology.\n6. Alex confronts Pakal Palen, the CEO of Amedeira Corporation, and learns about his obsession with the SCAM technology.\n7. Alex is captured by the corporate security forces and learns the truth about his wife\'s disappearance.\n8. With the help of Tom, Chuck, and Jenna, Alex escapes from the Amedeira Corporation.\n\nAct 3:\n\n1. Alex and his allies regroup and plan to expose Pakal Palen\'s nefarious plans.\n2. Alex confronts Gustavo about the true intentions behind the mission.\n3. Alex and his allies launch a daring attack on the Amedeira Corporation\'s headquarters to stop Pakal Palen and destroy the SCAM technology.\n4. Alex rescues his wife, Jessica, who has been secretly working against the Amedeira Corporation.\n5. Alex and his allies defeat Pakal Palen and expose his plans to the public.\n6. The SCAM technology is destroyed, and the power balance begins to shift in society.\n7. Alex and Jessica reunite, and Alex finds a new sense of purpose in fighting for justice and equality in this dystopian world.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [8420, 374, 279, 6049, 21101, 51813, 279, 31728, 3218, 220, 16, 1447, 3851, 25, 1863, 6721, 82293, 271, 2414, 220, 16, 1447, 16, 13, 28338, 311, 279, 68010, 47648, 1879, 315, 350, 63174, 3362, 11, 12270, 304, 220, 17, 15, 21, 15, 11, 21080, 389, 279, 5421, 315, 279, 10440, 23279, 23264, 5004, 323, 279, 10000, 315, 279, 57921, 1584, 624, 17, 13, 39398, 279, 58429, 28922, 11, 448, 9503, 24210, 82, 518, 279, 1909, 32