omato slices, fresh basil, and balsamic glaze.\n23. Taco pizza: Tomato sauce, mozzarella cheese, seasoned ground beef, lettuce, tomato, and cheddar cheese.\n24. Roasted vegetable: Olive oil, mozzarella cheese, roasted vegetables (such as zucchini, eggplant, and red pepper), and goat cheese.\n25. Shrimp scampi: Garlic butter, mozzarella cheese, shrimp, garlic, and parsley.\n26. Bacon cheeseburger: Tomato sauce, mozzarella cheese, ground beef, bacon, onions, and cheddar cheese.\n27. Prosciutto and arugula: Tomato sauce, mozzarella cheese, prosciutto, and arugula.\n28. Broccoli and cheddar: Olive oil, mozzarella cheese, steamed broccoli, and cheddar cheese.\n29. Clam pizza: Garlic butter, mozzarella cheese, clams, and parsley.\n30. Reuben pizza: Thousand Island dressing, mozzarella cheese, corned beef, sauerkraut, and Swiss cheese.\n31. Philly cheesesteak: Garlic butter, mozzarella cheese, thinly sliced steak, green peppers, and onions.\n32. Barbecue pork: BBQ sauce, mozzarella cheese, pork, red onion, and cilantro.\n33. Tuna: Tomato sauce, mozzarella cheese, tuna, and red onion.\n34. Lobster: Garlic butter, mozzarella cheese, lobster, and parsley", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [95456, 0, 5692, 594, 264, 1140, 315, 678, 279, 87770, 448, 13966, 1447, 16, 13, 23201, 1923, 6255, 25, 92991, 19187, 11, 4544, 95882, 17163, 11, 323, 7722, 67086, 624, 17, 13, 51782, 20783, 25, 92991, 19187, 11, 4544, 95882, 17163, 11, 323, 24353, 20783, 624, 18, 13, 58003, 25, 92991, 19187, 11, 4544, 95882, 17163, 11, 13515, 11, 323, 77082, 624, 19, 13, 44865, 32118, 25, 92991, 191