INFO 03-13 07:54:55 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-47ffa1c5cee94590b1472751a10ecb5c-0: prompt: "FADE IN:\n\nEXT. ICE PLANET - DAY\n\nThe camera pans over a barren, icy landscape. We see CAPTAIN KEIF, a rugged and determined-looking cosmonaut, trudging through the snow, his face set in a determined expression. He is accompanied by an AI DRONE, a small, spherical robot that hovers beside him.\n\nKEIF\n(to the drone)\nI've been scanning the planet for hours, and I still haven't found any signs of the sound I'm looking for.\n\nAI DRONE\n(in a robotic voice, with a hint of sarcasm)\nGee, what a surprise. Maybe if you weren't such a novice at this space exploration thing, we would have found it by now.\n\nKEIF\n(chuckling)\nHey, I'm doing the best I can.\n\nAI DRONE\n(rolling its eyes)\nSure, sure. Just keep telling yourself that.\n\nAs they make their way towards the mountain range, Keif and the drone come across a giant ice spider. The spider is huge, its body made of glistening ice, its eyes glowing red. It has a humanoid face, and a howling sound is coming from its mouth, it's the sound that Keif is searching for.\n\nKEIF\n(in shock)\nThat's the sound! But how do we get past this monster?\n\nAI DRONE\n(analyzing)\nMy scans indicate that the creature is guarding the sound. We will need to defeat it in order to obtain it. But don't worry, I'll do most of the heavy lifting.\n\nKEIF\n(amused)\nThanks for the vote of confidence.\n\nThe spider charges at Keif and the drone, its legs moving quickly despite its massive size. Keif uses his sonic blasts to attack it, while the drone releases a shower of sparks to distract the spider. Keif and the drone work together to dodge the spider's attacks, but the creature proves to be a formidable opponent.\n\nKEIF\n(panting)\nWe need to come up with a new plan!\n\nAI DRONE\n(analyzing)\nMy scans indicate that the creature's weak spot is its eyes. If we can blind it, we will have a better chance of defeating it. But I'll be the one doing the blinding, of course.\n\nKEIF\n(shaking his head)\nAlright, let's do it!\n\nWith renewed determination, Keif and the drone launch a coordinated attack on the spider's eyes. Keif uses his sonic blasts to shatter the ice, while the drone uses its sparks to blind the creature. The spider howls in pain and staggers backwards, giving Keif the opportunity to grab the sound.\n\nKEIF\n(triumphant)\nWe did it! We've got the sound!\n\nThe spider, however, isn't defeated yet, it starts to repair itself and move towards Keif.\n\nKEIF\n(worried)\nWe need to get out of here, now!\n\nAI DRONE\n(smirking)\nDon't worry, I've got this.\n\nThe drone releases a powerful blast of energy, destroying the spider and blasting a hole in the ice, allowing them to escape.\n\nKEIF\n(impressed)\nThanks, drone. I couldn't have done it without you.\n\nAI DRONE\n(in a robotic voice, with a hint of pride)\nAnytime, Captain. Anytime.\n\nThe camera lingers on the image of the ice planet receding in", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [3627, 1150, 1964, 1447, 5722, 13, 40563, 72566, 1348, 481, 37688, 271, 785, 6249, 63783, 916, 264, 93988, 11, 65904, 18414, 13, 1205, 1490, 26101, 51, 6836, 11090, 2773, 11, 264, 54783, 323, 10838, 30248, 7960, 1645, 2717, 11, 489, 87312, 1526, 279, 11794, 11, 806, 3579, 738, 304, 264, 10838, 7493, 13, 1260, 374, 23943, 553, 458, 15235, 14309, 5225, 11, 264, 2613, 11, 64151, 12305, 429, 305, 8969, 29388, 1435, 382, 3390, 2773, 198, 12186, 279, 26713, 340, 40, 3003, 1012, 35101, 279, 11580, 369, 4115, 11, 323, 358, 2058, 8990, 944, 1730, 894, 11929, 315, 