INFO 03-13 07:54:59 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-d46270969fcb43b69d8bffe9f9342c3a-0: prompt: "La Llorona\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can summon the spirits of her drowned children to aid her in battle, as well as create powerful whirlpools that can trap players.\n* Supporting Enemies: Water Wraiths, spirits of the drowned that can slow down and weaken players with their chilling touch.\n\nEl Chupacabra\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can roll into a ball and shoot its spines, create small earthquakes while jumping, and emit a high-pitched scream that stuns players.\n* Supporting Enemies: Lesser Chupacabras, smaller versions of the creature that can drain health from players and move quickly.\n\nEl Cucuy\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can turn invisible, summon shadow minions to attack players, and create a chilling aura that slows down players.\n* Supporting Enemies: Shadow Minions, creatures made of darkness that can also turn invisible and attack with their sharp claws.\n\nEl Sombrerón\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can charm the player, summon enchanted animals to attack, and create illusions to confuse players.\n* Supporting Enemies: Enchanted Animals, such as birds and snakes that are under El Sombrerón's control, which can use elemental attacks like wind and poison.\n\nEl Muerto\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can summon spectral chains to bind players, raise the undead to fight alongside him, and create a toxic cloud that deals damage over time.\n* Supporting Enemies: Undead Warriors, reanimated corpses wielding weapons that relentlessly attack players.\n\nLa Mala Hora\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can summon a dark cloud, create shadowy tendrils that snare players, and use her chilling gaze to deal damage over time.\n* Supporting Enemies: Night Horrors, dark apparitions that can inflict fear upon players, causing them to run uncontrollably or become unable to attack.\n\nLa Patasola\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can jump high distances, use her sharp claws to attack, and summon jungle creatures to aid her in battle.\n* Supporting Enemies: Jungle Beasts, such as venomous snakes and aggressive monkeys that can poison, stun, or disorient players.\n\nEl Silbón\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can throw bones at players, summon spectral hounds that track players, and use his haunting whistle to disorient players.\n* Supporting Enemies: Spectral Hounds, ghostly dogs that can track and surround players, dealing damage with their ethereal bites.\n\nNahuales\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can transform into various animals, like jaguars, eagles, or wolves, each with unique abilities and attack patterns.\n* Supporting Enemies: Lesser Nahuales, shape-shifters that can transform into smaller animals, like rats or bats, and swarm players.\n\nLa Ciguapa\n\n* Enhanced Abilities: Can charm victims with her beauty, summon wind and lightning storms, and create illusions of herself to confuse players.\n* Supporting Enemies: Elemental Wisps, small magical beings that can use elemental attacks, such as fire, ice, or lightning, against players.\n\nFor each boss encounter, the supporting enemies will appear in waves or alongside the main boss, adding an extra layer of challenge for the player. Players must use their skills and strategies to overcome these additional enemies while focusing on defeating the main boss.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [8747, 444, 9566, 6721, 271, 9, 61449, 79377, 25, 2980, 27545, 279, 30639, 315, 1059, 73895, 2841, 311, 12296, 1059, 304, 8049, 11, 438, 1632, 438, 1855, 7988, 63683, 79, 6178, 429, 646, 22862, 4217, 624, 9, 73996, 60481, 25, 9959, 4