 doing the blinding, of course.\n\nKEIF\n(shaking his head)\nAlright, let's do it!\n\nWith renewed determination, Keif and the drone launch a coordinated attack on the spider's eyes. Keif uses his sonic blasts to shatter the ice, while the drone uses its sparks to blind the creature. The spider howls in pain and staggers backwards, giving Keif the opportunity to grab the sound.\n\nKEIF\n(triumphant)\nWe did it! We've got the sound!\n\nThe spider, however, isn't defeated yet, it starts to repair itself and move towards Keif.\n\nKEIF\n(worried)\nWe need to get out of here, now!\n\nAI DRONE\n(smirking)\nDon't worry, I've got this.\n\nThe drone releases a powerful blast of energy, destroying the spider and blasting a hole in the ice, allowing them to escape.\n\nKEIF\n(impressed)\nThanks, drone. I couldn't have done it without you.\n\nAI DRONE\n(in a robotic voice, with a hint of pride)\nAnytime, Captain. Anytime.\n\nThe camera lingers on the image of the ice planet receding in", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [3627, 1150, 1964, 1447, 5722, 13, 40563, 72566, 1348, 481, 37688, 271, 785, 6249, 63783, 916, 264, 93988, 11, 65904, 18414, 13, 1205, 1490, 26101, 51, 6836, 11090, 2773, 11, 264, 54783, 323, 10838, 30248, 7960, 1645, 2717, 11, 489, 87312, 1526, 279, 11794, 11, 806, 3579, 738, 304, 264, 10838, 7493, 13, 1260, 374, 23943, 553, 458, 15235, 14309, 5225, 11, 264, 2613, 11, 64151, 12305, 429, 305, 8969, 29388, 1435, 382, 3390, 2773, 198, 12186, 279, 26713, 340, 40, 3003, 1012, 35101, 279, 11580, 369, 4115, 11, 323, 358, 2058, 8990, 944, 1730, 894, 11929, 315, 