cription: String\n)\n```\n4. Update the `ApiDetailRepository` interface to extend `ReactiveMongoRepository`:\n```kotlin\ninterface ApiDetailRepository : ReactiveMongoRepository<ApiDetail, String>\n```\n5. Update the `ApiDetailService` class to use the `ApiDetailRepository`:\n```kotlin\n@Service\nclass ApiDetailService(private val apiDetailRepository: ApiDetailRepository) {\n\n    fun getAllApiDetails(): Flux<ApiDetail> {\n        return apiDetailRepository.findAll()\n    }\n\n    fun getApiDetailById(id: String): Mono<ApiDetail> {\n        return apiDetailRepository.findById(id)\n    }\n\n    fun saveApiDetail(apiDetail: ApiDetail): Mono<ApiDetail> {\n        return apiDetailRepository.save(apiDetail)\n    }\n\n    fun deleteApiDetailById(id: String): Mono<Void> {\n        return apiDetailRepository.deleteById(id)\n    }\n}\n```\n6. Update the `ApiDetailController` class to use the `ApiDetailService`:\n```kotlin\n@RestController\n@RequestMapping("/api/v1/api-details")\nclass ApiDetailController(private val apiDetailService: ApiDetailService) {\n\n    @GetMapping("/")\n    fun getAllApiDetails(): Flux<ApiDetail> {\n        return apiDetailService.getAllApiDetails()\n    }\n\n    @GetMapping("/{id}")\n    fun getApiDetailById(@PathVariable("id") id: String): Mono<ApiDetail> {\n        return apiDetailService.getApiDetailById(id)\n    }\n\n    @PostMapping("/")\n    fun saveApiDetail(@RequestBody apiDetail: ApiDetail): Mono<ApiDetail> {\n        return apiDetailService.saveApiDetail\n```', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [39814, 11, 1588, 594, 458, 6049, 2038,