INFO 03-13 07:55:07 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-07750f16c9744515a497c4be0fff89ef-0: prompt: "Certainly! Let's continue with the MAPPO training loop in PyTorch.\n```python\n    optimizer.zero_grad()\n    total_loss = centralized_critic_loss + sum(policy_losses) + sum(value_losses)\n    total_loss.backward()\n    optimizer.step()\n```\nNow, let's implement a simple version of MAPPO in JAX:\n\nJAX MAPPO (Multi-agent):\n```python\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport optax\nfrom flax import linen as nn\n\nclass Policy(nn.Module):\n    def setup(self):\n        self.fc1 = nn.Dense(64)\n        self.fc2 = nn.Dense(action_dim)\n\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        x = nn.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        x = nn.softmax(self.fc2(x))\n        return x\n\nclass Value(nn.Module):\n    def setup(self):\n        self.fc1 = nn.Dense(64)\n        self.fc2 = nn.Dense(1)\n\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        x = nn.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        x = self.fc2(x)\n        return x\n\nclass CentralizedCritic(nn.Module):\n    def setup(self):\n        self.fc1 = nn.Dense(128)\n\n    def __call__(self, joint_state, joint_action):\n        x = jnp.concatenate([joint_state, joint_action], axis=-1)\n        x = nn.relu(self.fc1(x))\n        x = self.fc2(x)\n        return x\n\n# Collect experiences and calculate old_probs for each agent\n...\n\ndef mappo_loss(centralized_critic_params, policy_params, value_params, joint_states, joint_actions, rewards, next_joint_states, dones, old_probs, gamma, epsilon):\n    # Compute joint advantages\n    ...\n\n    # Centralized critic loss\n    ...\n\n    # Agent-specific policy and value losses\n    ...\n\n    return centralized_critic_loss, policy_losses, value_losses\n\n# Training loop\nnum_agents = 2\nstate_dim = 4\naction_dim = 2\n\npolicy_models = [Policy() for _ in range(num_agents)]\nvalue_models = [Value() for _ in range(num_agents)]\ncentralized_critic_model = CentralizedCritic()\n\npolicy_params = [policy.init(jax.random.PRNGKey(i), jnp.zeros((state_dim,))) for i, policy in enumerate(policy_models)]\nvalue_params = [value.init(jax.random.PRNGKey(i + num_agents), jnp.zeros((state_dim,))) for i, value in enumerate(value_models)]\ncentralized_critic_params = centralized_critic_model.init(jax.random.PRNGKey(2 * num_agents), jnp.zeros((num_agents * state_dim,)), jnp.zeros((num_agents * action_dim,)))\n\noptimizer = optax.adam(1e-3)\npolicy_opt_states = [optimizer.init(params) for params in policy_params]\nvalue_opt_states = [optimizer.init(params) for params in value_params]\ncentralized_critic_opt_state = optimizer.init(centralized_critic_params)\n\n@jax.jit\ndef update(centralized_critic_params, policy_params, value_params, policy_opt_states, value_opt_states, centralized_critic_opt_state, joint_states, joint_actions, rewards, next_joint_states, dones, old_probs, gamma, epsilon):\n    losses = mappo_loss(centralized_critic_params, policy_params, value_params, joint_states, joint_actions, rewards, next_joint_states, dones, old_probs, gamma, epsilon)\n    grads = jax.grad(mappo_loss, argnums=(0, 1, 2))(centralized_critic_params, policy_params, value_params, joint_states, joint_actions, rewards, next_joint_states, don\n```", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [95456, 0, 6771, 594, 3060, 448, 279, 27223, 2045, 4862, 6337, 304, 5355, 51, 21584, 624, 73594, 12669, 198, 262, 25632, 25847, 18352, 741, 262, 2790, 11193, 284, 57883, 666, 49208, 11193, 488, 2629, 72782, 66162, 8, 488, 2629, 3679, 66162, 340, 262, 2790, 11193, 65071, 741, 262, 25632, 21465, 741, 13874, 3989, 7039, 11, 1077, 594, 4211, 264,