INFO 03-13 07:55:07 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-889ef5b88c8e4bb59c6356a4d4b13164-0: prompt: 'Jacob sat in the dimly lit room, tending to Sarah as she lay in bed, still ill. The silence was only broken by her labored breathing and the sound of his movements as he straightened up the house. It was then that he spotted something on the shelf in the corner of the room. He walked over and picked up the ancient family heirloom tablet that Shiva and Kali had been admiring during their visit.\n\nHe held it in his hands, examining it closely. The tablet was crudely carved with images of two guardian spirits - one male, one female. He ran his fingers over the etchings, feeling the grooves and valleys created by time and weather. There was writing around the edges, but much of it was nearly illegible with age.\n\nJacob squinted, trying to make out the words. After a moment, he realized that it was a prayer, and he could make out two words: "Eri" and "Racita". He looked at the two figures on the tablet, and then back at the words. The prayer made him feel uneasy, as though he was uncovering something that was meant to remain hidden.\n\nHe placed the tablet back on the shelf, feeling as though he had disturbed something that was best left alone. But he couldn\'t shake the feeling that the tablet held the answers to the many questions that plagued him - about Lorelei, about Shiva and Kali, and about the mysterious mountain.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [94167, 7578, 304, 279, 5103, 398, 13020, 3054, 11, 259, 2459, 311, 20445, 438, 1340, 10962, 304, 4845, 11,