INFO 03-13 07:55:07 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-8719dbc923314d1da286e5a1ff3ac09c-0: prompt: 'Sure, here are 10 recipe ideas that blend what a young Latina and her older mother might be interested in, along with clever headlines/titles that connect mom and daughter:\n\n1. "Abuela\'s Empanadas with a Millennial Twist" - This recipe features a classic empanada recipe passed down from grandma, but with a modern twist on the filling such as avocado or quinoa.\n2. "Mama\'s Arroz con Pollo Gets a Makeover" - This classic chicken and rice dish gets updated with trendy ingredients like turmeric, quinoa, or plant-based meat.\n3. "Tostones with a Millennial Kick" - This recipe features classic fried plantains, but with a trendy avocado or sriracha aioli dip.\n4. "Abuela\'s Guacamole with a Twist" - This classic avocado dip gets a modern update with the addition of trendy ingredients like pomegranate seeds, jalapeño or vegan cheese.\n5. "Mama\'s Pozole with a Twist" - This traditional Mexican stew gets updated with trendy ingredients like tofu, quinoa or kale.\n6. "Churro Waffles: A Mother-Daughter Breakfast Delight" - This recipe combines two classic breakfast dishes, churros and waffles, for a delicious morning treat.\n7. "Millennial Tacos with Abuela\'s Salsa" - This recipe features trendy taco ingredients like jackfruit or cauliflower, paired with a classic salsa recipe passed down from grandma.\n8. "Mama\'s Enchiladas, Elevated" - This classic Mexican dish gets an upgrade with the addition of trendy ingredients like vegan cheese, or a unique filling like sweet potato or mushroom.\n9. "Sweet Potato Fries with Abuela\'s Secret Sauce" - This recipe features classic sweet potato fries, paired with a special sauce recipe passed down from grandma.\n10. "Millennial Mole with Mama\'s Touch" - This recipe features the traditional Mexican sauce, mole, but with a trendy twist on the ingredients such as avocado, pumpkin seeds, or quinoa, while still honoring the classic recipe passed down from mother to daughter.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [39814, 11, 1588, 525, 220, 16, 15, 11116, 6708, 429, 20334, 1128, 264, 3908, 58763, 323, 1059, 9014, 6554, 2578, 387, 8014, 304, 11, 3156, 448, 27699, 30086, 5523, 41243, 429, 4564, 3368, 323, 9803, 1447, 16, 13, 330, 5830, 23737, 594, 5748, 848, 11107, 448, 264, 8220, 31231, 73374, 1, 481, 1096, 11116, 4419, 264, 11416, 976, 848, 2584, 11116, 5823, 1495, 504, 82677, 11, 714, 448, 264, 6481, 26646, 389, 279, 21274, 1741, 438, 67246, 476, 922, 78994, 624, 17, 13, 330, 44, 3029, 594, 1644, 63989, 390, 3651, 385, 10310, 264, 7405, 1975, 1, 481, 1096, 11416, 16158, 323, 19653, 12000, 5221, 6049, 448, 57830, 13966, 1075, 13232, 2117, 11, 922, 78994, 11, 476, 6008, 5980, 13041, 624, 18, 13, 330, 51, 535, 3154, 448, 264, 8220, 31231, 26678, 1, 481, 1096, 11116, 4419, 11416, 40851, 6008, 1735, 11, 714, 448, 264, 57830, 67246, 476, 18962, 404, 51576, 16391, 14225, 23604, 624, 19, 13, 330, 5830, 23737, 594, 4570, 95608, 1263, 448, 264, 73374, 1, 481, 1096, 11416, 67246, 23604, 5221, 264, 6481, 2647, 448, 279, 5256, 315, 57830, 13966, 1075, 281, 635, 67063, 349, 19056, 11, 75974, 2027, 14529, 476, 29149, 17163, 624, 20, 13, 330, 44, 3029, 594, 78985, 1263, 448, 264, 73374, 1, 481, 1096, 8606, 23279, 60343, 5221, 6049, 448, 57830, 13966, 1075, 79147, 11, 922, 78994, 476, 62477, 624, 21, 13, 330, 1143, 324, 299, 467, 80535, 25, 362, 21043, 9420, 64, 7340, 43191, 7313, 491, 1, 481, 1096, 11116, 32411, 1378, 11416, 17496, 25779, 11, 521, 324, 3630, 323, 289, 80535, 11, 369, 264, 17923, 6556, 4228, 62