INFO 03-13 07:55:17 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-2cc37cc15e3340babb168031a262b9fa-0: prompt: "If you're experiencing depression, there are some steps you can take to help you feel better. Here is a general step-by-step treatment protocol that may be helpful for you:\n\n1. Assessment and Evaluation: The first step is to have your symptoms and mental health history evaluated. This will help determine the severity of your depression and develop a personalized treatment plan.\n2. Education: Learn about depression, its symptoms, and causes. Understand that depression is treatable and recovery is possible.\n3. Goal Setting: Work with your therapist to set specific, measurable, achievable, relevant, and time-bound goals for your treatment. Set both short-term and long-term goals.\n4. Behavioral Activation: Engage in activities you enjoy and find fulfilling. This can help counteract feelings of apathy and hopelessness associated with depression.\n5. Cognitive Restructuring: Identify and challenge negative thoughts and beliefs that contribute to your depression. Replace negative thoughts with positive, more realistic ones.\n6. Problem-Solving: Develop effective problem-solving skills to help you cope with stressors and challenges that may contribute to your depression.\n7. Interpersonal Therapy: Improve your communication and relationship skills, and work through any relationship problems that may be contributing to your depression.\n8. Mindfulness and Relaxation: Learn mindfulness and relaxation techniques to help reduce stress and anxiety and promote relaxation.\n9. Support: Seek support from loved ones and connect with community resources and support groups.\n10. Medication: Consider medication as part of your treatment plan, if appropriate. Consult with a psychiatrist to determine the best medication for your symptoms and monitor your progress.\n\nRemember that depression is a complex condition, and recovery is a process that takes time and effort. Be patient and persistent in your treatment, and seek support and guidance along the way.", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [2679, 498, 2299, 24084, 18210, 11, 1052, 525, 1045, 7354, 498, 646, 1896, 311, 1492, 498, 2666, 2664, 13, 5692, 374, 264, 4586, 3019, 14319, 29208, 6380, 11507, 429, 1231, 387, 10950, 369, 498, 1447, 16, 13, 36257, 323, 39288, 25, 576, 1156, 3019, 374, 311, 614, 697, 13495, 323, 10502, 2820, 3840, 25070, 13, 1096, 686, 1492, 8253, 279, 29920, 315, 697, 18210, 323, 2225, 264, 34549, 6380, 3119, 624, 17, 13, 11668, 25, 14934, 911, 18210, 11, 1181, 13495, 11, 323, 11137, 13, 70894, 429, 18210, 374, 4228, 480, 323, 13351, 374, 3204, 624, 18, 13, 39947, 20037, 25, 5547, 448, 697, 41763, 311, 738, 3151, 11, 65203, 11, 88153, 11, 9760, 11, 323, 882, 49862, 8845, 369, 697, 6380, 13, 2573, 2176, 2805, 9663, 323, 1293, 9663, 8845, 624, 19, 13, 71984, 49647, 25, 3285, 424, 304, 7488, 498, 4669, 323, 1477, 49598, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 5546, 531, 15650, 315, 1443, 19135, 323, 3900, 31928, 5815, 448, 18210, 624, 20, 13, 72135, 41327, 667, 1677, 25, 64547, 323, 8645, 8225, 11303, 323, 20799, 429, 16792, 311, 697, 18210, 13, 29558, 8225, 11303, 448, 6785, 11, 803, 25489, 6174, 624, 21, 13, 22079, 6222, 19648, 25, 7843, 7373, 3491, 98146, 7361, 311, 1492, 498, 36486, 448, 8464, 1087, 323, 11513, 429, 1231, 16792, 311, 697, 18210, 624, 22, 13, 5665, 29612, 39043, 25, 64084, 697, 10535, 323, 5025, 7361, 11, 323, 975, 1526, 894, 5025, 5322, 429, 1231, 387, 28720, 311, 697, 18210, 624, 23, 13, 22904, 30414, 323, 67585, 367, 25, 14934, 70605, 323, 42585, 12538, 311, 1492,