INFO 03-13 07:55:18 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-41af4ae5d3694a0ba9360a5b2e3263e0-0: prompt: 'This section talks about the concept of energy and pattern in the universe of universes. It explains that energy is an all-inclusive term applied to spiritual, mindal, and material realms and that force and power are also used but with different meanings. The section also introduces the concept of cosmic force, emergent energy, and universe power, which are different levels of energy-matter. The section also explains that pattern can be projected as material, spiritual, or mindal and is a configuration of reality. It states that Paradise is the absolute of patterns, the Eternal Son is the pattern personality, and the Universal Father is the direct ancestor-source of both. However, it also notes that Paradise does not bestow pattern and the Son cannot bestow personality.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [1986, 3772, 13433, 911, 279, 7286, 315, 4802, 323, 5383, 304, 279, 15494, 315, 10919, 288, 13, 1084, 14758, 429, 4802, 374, 458, 678, 3419, 8336, 4647, 9251, 311, 17849, 11, 3971, 278, 11, 323, 3684, 76463, 323, 429, 5344, 323, 2355, 525, 1083, 1483, 714, 448, 2155, 49700, 13, 576, 3772, 1083, 38919, 279, 7286, 315, 54701, 5344, 11, 7277, 306, 4802, 11, 323, 15494, 2355, 11, 892, 525, 2155, 5866, 315, 4802, 1448, 1650, 13, 576, 3772, 1083, 14758, 429, 5383, 646, 387, 27348, 438, 3684, 11, 17849, 11, 476, 3971, 278, 323, 374, 264, 6546, 315, 8729, 13, 1084, 5302, 429, 47591, 374, 279, 10740, 315, 12624, 11, 279, 66772, 11840, 374, 279, 5383, 17294, 11, 323, 2