INFO 03-13 07:55:21 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-e197a512a3314112a3df2384a5c10029-0: prompt: 'Sure, here\'s a more detailed summary of the storyline involving Jon Kent and Damian Wayne, with a focus on their early childhood, including their ages when they moved around, where they lived, and when their stories converged:\n\nJon Kent, the son of Superman and Lois Lane, was born during the "Convergence" storyline. After Superman\'s powers were temporarily depowered, Lois discovered that she was pregnant, and their son Jon inherited some of Superman\'s powers. To protect Jon from danger and keep his powers a secret, the Kents moved to a farm in Hamilton County, near Metropolis.\n\nJon was born in the year 2015, and his early childhood was heavily influenced by his parents\' desire to keep him safe and their need to keep his powers a secret. The Kents moved around frequently, including to a farmhouse in Hamilton County, an apartment in Metropolis, and a small town in Kansas. Jon was homeschooled by his parents and kept largely isolated from the outside world.\n\nAs a young child, Jon was a curious and empathetic boy who longed for more interactions with other kids. His parents tried to protect him from the dangers of the world, but they also tried to nurture his desire to help others.\n\nDamian Wayne, the son of Batman and Talia al Ghul, was born in the year 2006. Talia, seeking to create the ultimate heir to her father Ra\'s al Ghul\'s legacy, drugged and seduced Bruce Wayne, and then raised Damian in secret in the League of Assassins.\n\nAs a child, Damian was raised in the League of Assassins, where he was trained in martial arts and combat from a young age. He grew up in a world of violence and death, and believed himself to be the rightful heir to the mantle of the Dark Knight. Damian\'s mother, Talia al Ghul, was heavily involved in his upbringing, and his grandfather, Ra\'s al Ghul, was a major figure in his life.\n\nAt the age of ten, Damian was sent to Gotham City to live with his father, Bruce Wayne. Damian struggled to fit in with his father\'s world, and his combative nature often led to clashes with others.\n\nWhen Jon and Damian first met in the Superman comic series, they were roughly the same age, with Damian being a few years older. They met for the first time when Damian interrupted Jon\'s peaceful life on the Kent farm, seeking Superman\'s help with a mission.\n\nDespite their initial differences, Jon and Damian developed a begrudging friendship, and they eventually became close friends. Their shared experiences as the children of superheroes and the pressures of their respective legacies brought them closer together.\n\nTheir stories converged in the Super Sons series, where they formed their own superhero team and worked together to take on various villains and threats. They continued to work together in various crossover events and storylines, exploring the challenges of growing up as the children of two of the world\'s greatest superheroes.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [39814, 11, 1588, 594, 264, 803, 11682, 12126, 315, 279, 50628, 15860, 12285, 17734, 323, 90955, 27540, 11, 448, 264, 5244, 389, 862, 4124, 19990, 11, 2670, 862, 16639, 979, 807, 7726, 2163, 11, 1380, 807, 12163, 11, 323, 979, 862, 7343, 96775, 1447, 37152, 17734, 11, 279, 4438, 315, 37709, 323, 83946, 26018, 11, 572, 9223, 2337, 279, 330, 1109, 80748, 1, 50628, 13, 4636, 37709, 594, 13430, 1033, 27092, 2170, 79213, 11, 83946, 11105, 429, 1340, 572, 20280, 11, 323, 862, 4438, 12285, 26990, 1045, 315, 37709, 594, 13430, 13, 