INFO 03-13 07:55:22 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-f909b93989104ead8037d975c2d70687-0: prompt: 'Email 1: Introduction and Thank You\n\n* Subject: "Thank you for downloading our Trip Wire Offer"\n* Body: Thank you for downloading our Trip Wire Offer. We hope you found it valuable and informative. In this email flow, we will be sharing more information about our "Autopilot Outsourcing" course and how it can help you save time and increase productivity as a busy professional.\n\nEmail 2: The Problem\n\n* Subject: "Are you struggling to keep up with the demands of your business?"\n* Body: As a busy professional, you know how challenging it can be to keep up with the demands of your business. From managing tasks, to finding great talent, it can be overwhelming. In this email, we will be discussing some of the most common problems busy professionals and small business owners face when it comes to outsourcing.\n\nEmail 3: The Solution\n\n* Subject: "Introducing the solution: Autopilot Outsourcing"\n* Body: In the previous email, we discussed the common problems busy professionals and small business owners face when it comes to outsourcing. In this email, we will be introducing our solution: the Autopilot Outsourcing course. This course is designed to help you save time and increase productivity by outsourcing tasks to virtual assistants effectively.\n\nEmail 4: The Benefits\n\n* Subject: "Discover the benefits of our Autopilot Outsourcing course"\n* Body: In the previous email, we introduced our Autopilot Outsourcing course as the solution to the common problems busy professionals and small business owners face when it comes to outsourcing. In this email, we will be highlighting the key benefits of the course and how it can help you achieve your business and career goals.\n\nEmail 5: The Offer\n\n* Subject: "Limited time offer: Enroll in Autopilot Outsourcing now"\n* Body: In the previous emails, we\'ve discussed the problems, the solution, and the benefits of our Autopilot Outsourcing course. Now, we are excited to offer you the opportunity to enroll in the course at a special, limited-time discount. This is your chance to finally take control of your time, increase productivity, and achieve your business and career goals.\n\nEmail 6: The Scarcity\n\n* Subject: "Last chance to enroll in Autopilot Outsourcing"\n* Body: This is the final reminder that the enrollment period for our Autopilot Outsourcing course is closing soon. This is your last chance to take advantage of our special, limited-time discount and learn the secrets to outsourcing like a pro. Don\'t miss out on this opportunity to save time, increase productivity, and achieve your business and career goals.\n\nEmail 7: The Testimonial\n\n* Subject: "Success stories from our Autopilot Outsourcing graduates"\n* Body: In this final email, we want to share with you the success stories of some of our Autopilot Outsourcing graduates. Hear from people just like you who have taken the course and how it has helped them to save time, increase productivity and achieve their business and career goals.\n\nEmail 8: The Follow Up\n\n* Subject: "Don\'t miss out on this opportunity"\n* Body: If you haven\'t enrolled in our Autopilot Outsourcing course yet, we want to remind you that the', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [4781, 220, 16, 25, 28338, 323, 9731, 1446, 271, 9, 17450, 25, 330, 13060, 498, 369, 32477, 1039, 26754, 19378, 24498, 698, 9, 13958, 25, 9731, 498, 369, 32477, 1039, 26754, 19378, 24498, 13, 1205, 3900, 498, 1730, 432, 15172, 323, 38219, 13, 758, 419, 2551, 63