INFO 03-13 07:55:27 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-2b8aa7d1f69c44d5a2ef2420e9dd72ba-0: prompt: "As a Senior Digital Advertising Strategist with 6 years of experience, I specialize in creating innovative and data-driven campaigns for progressive causes. My expertise lies in leveraging the power of data, new technologies, and creative storytelling to deliver measurable results for my clients.\n\nThroughout my career, I have helped diverse organizations develop integrated, audience-first marketing strategies that combine digital, TV, radio, and print. My key skills include Digital Advertising, Data-Driven Strategies, Integrated Marketing, Email List Building, Direct Response Tactics, Multichannel Campaigns, ROI Optimization, Persuasion, and Mobilization.\n\nSome of my accomplishments include:\n\n* Working with the Biden Victory Fund to manage an eight-figure multi-channel direct response ads program, achieving a 900% ROI in under 3 months for list rentals, 1.4 million online contributions, and 1.5 million email list sign-ups.\n* Raising over $1.6 million for Lucas Kunce for Missouri's U.S. Senate campaign through digital persuasion, mobilization, online fundraising, and email acquisition.\n* Supporting John Fetterman's U.S. Senate campaign by raising over $10.7 million through digital persuasion, mobilization, online fundraising, and email acquisition.\n* Assisting environmental non-profit 350.org in raising over $104,000 through online fundraising and email acquisition.\n* Collaborating with other progressive political organizations such as the Justice Democrats, Sunrise Movement, and Working Families Party to drive fundraising, mobilization, and awareness.\n\nAs the digital landscape continues to evolve, I remain committed to staying ahead of industry trends and utilizing my skills to help clients achieve their goals. Outside of work, I am passionate about exploring new cultures, capturing the beauty of nature through photography, and giving back to my community by volunteering at local non-profits.\n\nIf you're interested in discussing how my expertise can help your organization achieve its goals or simply want to connect and chat about the latest trends in digital advertising, feel free to reach out via LinkedIn or email me at [[your.email@email.com](mailto:your.email@email.com)].", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: [2121, 264, 19342, 14102, 46323, 28223, 380, 448, 220, 21, 1635, 315, 3139, 11, 358, 47344, 304, 6825, 18199, 323, 821, 31405, 20686, 369, 22257, 11137, 13, 3017, 18726, 15448, 304, 76482, 279, 2355, 315, 821, 11, 501, 14310, 11, 323, 11521, 47829, 311, 6359, 65203, 3059, 369, 847, 8239, 382, 59005, 847, 6931, 11, 358, 614, 8910, 16807, 11104, 2225, 18250, 11, 10650, 36943, 8493, 14830, 429, 15963, 7377, 11, 5883, 11, 8887, 11, 323, 1173, 13, 3017, 1376, 7361, 2924, 14102, 46323, 11, 2885, 12, 98484, 55519, 11, 49421, 18228, 11, 8299, 1759, 16858, 11, 7139, 5949, 93838, 11, 22162, 713, 2594, 26545, 82, 11, 50652, 57739, 11, 20465, 84, 17766, 11, 323, 69830, 2022, 382, 8373, 315, 847, 52781, 2924, 1447, 9, 22150, 448, 279, 37080, 48327, 13190, 311, 10091, 458, 8063, 98996, 7299, 53868, 2118, 2033, 13740, 2025, 11, 31045, 264, 220, 24, 15, 15, 4, 50652, 304, 1212, 220, 18, 3951, 369, 1140, 47004, 11, 220, 16, 13, 19, 3526, 2860, 19026, 11, 323, 220, 16, 13, 20, 3526, 2551, 1140, 1841, 26761, 624, 9, 431, 50126, 916, 400, 16, 13, 21, 3526, 369, 31003, 42783, 346, 369, 24378, 594, 547, 808, 13, 9891, 4796, 1526, 7377, 97124, 11, 28805, 2022, 11, 2860, 36319, 11, 323, 2551, 23390, 624, 9, 73996, 3757, 434, 