INFO 03-13 07:55:28 logger.py:39] Received request cmpl-5239143e89be4ab2b3b05e516b5cec87-0: prompt: 'Haruka stands on the edge of the pool, staring off into the distance. Rin approaches him, the water rippling around him as he enters the pool.\n\n"Hey," Rin says, a note of concern in his voice. "You\'ve been staring off into space for a while now. Is something on your mind?"\n\nHaruka shakes his head, but Rin can tell he\'s lying. Rin has known Haruka for too long not to notice when something is bothering him.\n\n"Is it Seina?" Rin asks, and Haruka\'s eyes widen in surprise.\n\n"I don\'t know what you\'re talking about," Haruka says, his voice tight.\n\nRin narrows his eyes. "Don\'t play dumb with me, Haru. I can tell there\'s something going on between you two."\n\nHaruka doesn\'t answer, just stares down at the water.\n\nRin sighs. "Look, I know this is complicated. We both have feelings for her, and it\'s messing with our heads. But we can\'t let it come between us."\n\nHaruka nods, still not looking at Rin. "I know. I just... I don\'t know what to do."\n\nRin reaches out and takes Haruka\'s hand, giving it a reassuring squeeze. "We\'ll figure it out together. Just promise me that you won\'t shut me out, no matter what happens."\n\nHaruka finally looks up at Rin, his eyes softening. "I promise."\n\nThe two of them sit in silence for a while, watching the other swimmers in the pool. Haruka feels a sense of peace wash over him, knowing that Rin is there for him no matter what. But at the same time, he can\'t shake the feeling that something is about to change between them, and he\'s not sure if he\'s ready for it.', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=True, max_tokens=256, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_betwe